<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">JOHN-POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">YOHANI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHISOWERU SHIWAGIRA SHAKALEMBITI</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Yohani ndo shimu pakati pa vintola vyamsheshi Mulipatanu lya Syayi, vyavilanguziya makaliru ga Yesu Kristu. Kila shimu shishemwa “Injili mana yakuwi Shisoweru Shiwagira.” Vintola avi vilembitwi na Matayu na Mariku na Luka na Yohani pakahowiti kala Yesu. Shintola ashi sha Shisoweru Shiwagira pamonga shilembwa na ntumintumi Yohani mushinja sha malongu tisa Pakwiyuka Yesu. Pamuhera na aga shintola ashi shilonga ndiri kuwera Yohani ndo yakalembiti, ntambu ya kulemba ilifana nentu na mahamba galii ga 1Yohani na 2Yohani na 3Yohani. Walemba wamu wa makashu walonga kuwera shintola ashi shilembitwi Efesu toziya kwa shaka ashi Yohani kalikaliti mulushi alu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohani kankutakulira nfiru ya shintola ashi ndo kuwatanga wantu wajimiri kuwera Yesu ndo Kristu Mlopoziya, Mwana gwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu 20:31. Kwa kugajimira aga tuweza kulikala kwa litawu lyakuwi. Shintola ashi shilembelwa su shibetulwi na wantu woseri Wayawudi na wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi. Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Yohani kwa ntambu yimu vilinganira ndiri na vintola vyamonga vilii vitatu. Yomberi kaloliti nentu mumauzauza gagatenditwi na Yesu na kalembiti ndiri nentu kuusu mifanu ya Yesu, viraa kalembiti ndiri mushintola ashi vitwatira vilii vikulu gambira ubatizu wa Yesu na kujerwa kwakuwi kushiwala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani kanja Shisoweru Shiwagira, shipandi sha 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu kankulemba mauzauza gamu geni Yesu kagatenditi, shipandi sha 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu kalanguziya vitwatira vyavilawiliti vya makaliru ga Yesu yagalongoziya kuhowa kwakuwi na kuzyuka, shipandi sha 13:1-20:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani kankumalalira Shisoweru Shiwagira, shipandi sha 21 pakalongiti kuusu Yesu pakawalawiriti wantu pakuzyuka kwakuwi na shakapanu nfiru yakuwi ya kulemba shintola ashi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Shisoweru sha Ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Panjiti lipaga kuweriti na Shisoweru, Shisoweru kaweriti pamuhera na Mlungu, nayomberi kaweriti Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kwanjira kwanja Shisoweru kaweriti pamuhera na Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kupitila shisoweru, Mlungu kawumbiti vintu vyoseri, kwahera ata shintu shimu shawashiwumbitwi pota nayomberi. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Shisoweru ndo shyanziru sha makaliru na makaliru aga gajegiti weru kwa wantu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Uweru awu ulangala muntiti na ntiti hapeni izimiziyi uweru awu.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Mlungu kamtumiti mjumbi gwakuwi litawu lyakuwi Yohani, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yakiziti kuwapitawulira wantu kuusu uweru awu, su woseri wapikaniriti ujumbi na wajimiri. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohani kaweriti ndiri uweru, ira kiziti hera kuwagambira wantu kuusu uweru awu. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Awu ndo weru wanakaka, weru wankwiza pasipanu, kuwawalira wantu woseri.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Shisoweru kaweriti pasipanu. Mlungu kanyawiti pasipanu kupitira Shisoweru, kumbiti wantu wa pasipanu wamumana ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Kiziti muisi yakuwi mweni, kumbiti wantu wakuwi mweni wamuwanka ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kumbiti wamonga yawamuwankiti na kumjimira, awa kawapananiti uwezu wa kuwera wana wa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Womberi waweriti ndiri wana wa Mlungu kwa uwezu wa wantu ama kwa makakala ga nshimba ama kwa kufira kwa muntu, ira Mlungu mweni kawatenditi waweri wana wakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Shisoweru kaweriti muntu, kalikaliti na twenga, kaweriti upendelewu nentu pamuhera na unakaka. Tuwoniti ukwisa wakuwi, ukwisa yakauwankiti wa Mwana gwa gweka gwa Tati.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohani kawagambira wantu kuusu Shisoweru. Kabotanga, “Ayu ndo ulii yanumtakuliti shaka pantakuliti, ‘Paneni kankwiza muntu yumu, yomberi ndo mkulu kuliku neni, toziya kaweriti kala neni naniyiwuki.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kulawira na upendelewu uvuwa wakuwi, katutekeleriti woseri, katupananiti utekeleru na utekeleru. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mlungu katupananiti Lilagaliru kupitira Musa, kumbiti upendelewu na unakaka viziti kupitira Yesu Kristu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kwahera muntu yakamwoniti Mlungu. Kumbiti Mwana gwa gweka yakaweriti Mlungu na yakaweriti uwega wa Tati gwakuwi, ndo yakatenditi kamanikani.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Awu ndo upitawu wa Yohani kwa wakulu wa Wayawudi Yerusalemu kulii pawawatumiti watambika wamu na wantu wa ukowu wa Lawi wa numba ya Mlungu wagendi kwa Yohani wamkosiyi, “Gwenga gwa gaa?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohani kalemiti ndiri kuwankula, ira katakuliti pota na kufifa, kalongiti, “Neni na Kristu ndiri yakasyagulitwi na Mlungu kuwalopoziya wantu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Womberi wamkosiya, “Su, gwenga gwa gaa? Gwenga gwa Eliya?” Yohani kawankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ndala, neni ndiri.” Wamkosiya kayi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Gwenga ndo ulii Mbuyi gwa Mlungu yawamtakuliti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohani Kawankula, “Ndala!”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Nawomberi wamgambira, “Su, gutugambiri gwenga gwa gaa? Su gutakula hashi kuusu gumweni? Hatugendi kutakula ntambu yagutuwankula kwa walii yawatutumiti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohani kawankula ntambu yakalembiti Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Neni ndo liziwu lya muntu yakabotanga mushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Mnyawi njira yakupitira Mtuwa!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Wajumbi yawatumitwi na Mafalisayu, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />wamkosiyiti Yohani, “Paguwera ndiri Kristu, ama Eliya, ama ulii Mbuyi gwa Mlungu, iwera hashi gubatiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohani kawankula, “Neni mbatiza kwa mashi, kumbiti kwana yumu pakati penu yamummana ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Paneni kankwiza, neni herepa ndiri ata kuyopola lugoyi zya vilyatu vyakuwi.”<figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Muntu kavala vilwatu</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Vitwatila vyoseri vyavilawiriti Betaniya kusika mwa lushemba lwa Yoridani, pahala Yohani pakawera kankubatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mwana Kondolu gwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Shirawu yakuwi, Yohani kamwoniti Yesu kankumwizira. Yohani katakula, “Ayu ndo Mwana Kondolu gwa Mlungu, yakawusiya vidoda vya wantu wa pasipanu! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ayu ndo ulii yanumtakuliti, pantakuliti, ‘Paneni kamkwiza muntu yumu mkulu kuliku neni, toziya kaweriti kala neni haneniyiwuki.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Namweni numumaniti ndiri, kumbiti niziti kubatiza kwa mashi su yomberi kamanikana kwa wantu wa Israeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Na awu ndo upitawu Yohani yakautakuliti, “Moniti Rohu Mnanagala kankusuluka gambira ngunda pakiza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu na kumkangalira. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Neni numumana ndiri kuwera yomberi ndo uliya yanumtakuliti, su Mlungu yakantumiti neni kubatiza kwa mashi, kang'ambiriti, ‘Hagumwoni Rohu pakamsulukira muntu kulawa kumpindi, ndo ulii yakabatiza kwa Rohu Mnanagala.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yohani katakuliti, Neni moniti, nuwagambirani nakaka kuwera ayu ndo Mwana gwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantumintumi wa kwanja wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Shirawu yakuwi, Yohani kaweriti kayi paliya pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi wawili, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />pakamwoniti Yesu kankupita katakula, “Ayu ndo Mwana Kondolu gwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Wafundwa wawili pawapikaniriti aga, su wagenda pamuhera na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu kagalambukiti, kawawoniti wankumfata, su kawakosiya, “Mwankusakula shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Womberi wamwankula, “Rabi” mana yakuwi “mfunda” gulikala koshi?<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwizi, muloli.” Iweriti handa saa lilongu pamihi. Su wagenditi pamuhera na yomberi na wapawoniti pahala pakalikaliti. Walikaliti pamuhera na Yesu lishaka lyoseri.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andereya, mlongu gwa Simoni Peteru, yakampikiniriti Yohani pakalonga na mweni kamfatiti Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andereya kamwoniti kwanja mlongu gwakuwi Simoni, kamgambira, “Tumwoniti ulii Mlopoziya yakasyaguritwi na Mlungu” Ayu ndo Kristu Mlopoziya. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Su wamjegiti Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu kamlola Simoni na kalonga, “Litawu lyaku ndo Simoni mwana gwa Yohani, Kumbiti hagushemuwi Kefa.” Kwa Shigiriki ndo Peteru, mana yakuwi “Litalawu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawashema Filipu na Nataniyeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Shirawu yakuwi Yesu kaamuwiti kugenda Galilaya. Su kamwoniti Filipu, kamgambira, “Gunfati!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipu kaweriti mwenikaya gwa Betisayida, lushi lyawalikaliti ashina Andereya na Peteru. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipu kamwoniti Nataniyeri na kamgambira, “Tumwona ulii mweni Musa kamlembiti mushintora sha Malagaliru na wambuyi wa Mlungu walembiti kuusu mweni. Mweni ndo Yesu mwana gwa Yosefu, kulawa Nazareti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nataniyeri kamkosiya Filipu, “Kwana shintu shoseri shiherepa shiza kulawa Nazareti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipu kamwankula, “Gwizi guloli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu pakamwoniti Nataniyeri kankumwizira, katakuliti kuusu yomberi, “Mloli! Ayu ndo Mwisraeli nakaka, kwahera shinika kwakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nataniyeri kamkosiya “Gumana ashi neni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu kamwankula, “Pamberi pa Filipu kukushema, nukuwoniti pagulivagiti pasi pa mtera gwa mkuyu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nataniyeri kamwankula, “Mfunda, Gwenga ndo Mwana gwa Mlungu! Gwenga gwa Mfalumi gwa Israeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu kamgambira, “Hashi, gujimira toziya nukugambiriti kuwera nukuwoniti pasi pa mtera gwa mkuyu? Haguwoni vikulu nentu vivuwa kuliku avi!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Na Yesu kawagambiriti womberi, “Nankuwagambirani mwenga nakaka, hamuwoni kumpindi kwa Mlungu kuvuguka na wantumintumi wa kumpindi pawakwena na kumsulukira Mwana gwa Muntu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Ndowa mulushi lwa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Lishaka lya tatu kuweriti ndowa mulushi lwa Kana, kumkowa Galilaya. Mawu gwakuwi Yesu kaweriti palaa, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi nawomberi wawashemiriti ku ndowa. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divayi payiperiti, mawu gwa Yesu kamgambira, “Kwahera divayi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu kamwankula, “Mawu, nagung'ambira shakutenda. Saa yaneni yankali.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Mawu gwa Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi, “Mtendi shoseri shakawagambireni.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Palii paweriti na vulu sita zya mabuwi na kila lumu luweziti kutulwa mashi shyasi sha madebi mawili ama matatu. Iweriti wayitula paliii toziya ya shitiba sha Shiyawudi sha kunawira. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi, “Mumemiziyi viwiga avi mashi.” Nawomberi wavimemiziya mashi nduu, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />shakapanu kawagambira, “Vinu mteki mashi aga mwakamjegeri mkulu gwa msambu.” Womberi watola mashi na kumjegera yomberi, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />su vinu mashi gagalambusiwa gawera divayi na kagalawalira. Mkulu gwa msambu kavimana ndiri kwayilawiriti divayi, su wantumintumi pawatekiti mashi wavimaniti, mkulu gwa msambu kamshemiti mpalu gwa ndowa <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />kamgambira, “Kila muntu kaitandaga divayi iherepa huti ata pawikuta kala, kaitandaga ilii ifaa ndiri. Kumbiti gwenga guitula divayi iherepa mpaka vinu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu katenda liuzauza ali lya kwanja haku Kana mu Galilaya, kaulanguziya ukwisa wakuwi na wafundwa wakuwi wamjimira.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Pagalawiriti kala aga, Yesu pamuhera na mawu gwakuwi na walongu wakuwi na wafundwa wagenditi Kafarinaumu na walikaliti kulii mashaka gavuwa ndiri.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayu 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mariku 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Msambu gwa Pasaka gwa Wayawudi guweriti gwa pakwegera, su Yesu kagenditi Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu kawawoniti wantu wankushuwuza wang'ombi na wakondolu na wangunda na viraa wantu wamonga wankuvunjira mpiya pawalivaga pavitalawanda zawu. <figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Mshuwuza kankuvunja mpiya</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Kanyawiti ntomondu ya lugoyi na kawawinga wavigongolu woseri walawi kunja kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, pamuhera na wakondolu na wang'ombi, kazigalambuziya vintalawanda vyawatendiriti kuvunjira mpiya na kuzipalasiya mpiya zawu, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />na kawagambira walii woseri yawaweriti wankuwuza wangunda, “Muusii vintu avi panu! Muleki kutenda numba ya Tati gwangu iweri pahala pa soku!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Wafundwa wakuwi waliholiti Malembu ntambu yagalembitwi, “Mlungu, kulilaviya kwaneni munumba mwaku kuyaka mumoyu mwangu gambira motu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Wakulu wa Shiyawudi wamu wamkosiya Yesu, “Hagutendi liuzauza gaa kutulanguziya twenga handa gwana uwezu kutenda vitwatira avi?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu kawankula, “Hambomoli Numba nkulu ya Mlungu ayi, neni hanuyijengi kayi kwa mashaka matatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Wayawudi wamkosiya, “Numba nkulu ya Mlungu ayi wainyawiti kwa mivinja malongu msheshi na sita! Hashi, gwenga hagujengi kwa mashaka matatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Kumbiti numba nkulu ya Mlungu Yesu yakayitakuliti ndo nshimba yakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Su pakazyukisiwitwi kulawa kwa wahowiti, wafundwa wakuwi waliholiti handa katakuliti aga na wagajimiriti Malembu Mananagala na shilii shakatakuliti Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kayimana myoyu ya wantu woseri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu pakaweriti Yerusalemu shaka sha msambu gwa Pasaka, wantu wavuwa wamjimiriti pawawoniti mauzauza gakatenditi. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Yesu kalilaviya ndiri kwa womberi, toziya kayimaniti myoyu yawu woseri. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Kafira ndiri wamgambiri shoseri kuusu wantu, toziya kavimaniti weri vitwatira vyoseri yaviweriti mumyoyu mwawu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kuweriti na mkulu gwa Shiyawudi yawamshema Nikodemu, kaweriti gwa shipinga sha Mafalisayu. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Lishaka limu kamgendera Yesu pashiru na kamgambira, “Mfunda, tuvimana handa gwenga gwa mfunda yagutumitwi na Mlungu. Kwahera muntu yakaweziti kutenda mauzauza gagutenda mpaka Mlungu kapamuhera na yomberi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu kamwankula, “Nankugambira nakaka, Kwahera muntu yakaweza kuwona Ufalumi wa Mlungu, pakayiwuka kayi ndiri.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu kamkosiya, “Muntu mkulu kaweza hashi kwiwuka kayi? Hashi, kaweza kwingira mumtima mwa mawu gwakuwi na kwiwuka mala ya pili?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 3:5">“Nakaka nukugambira, muntu yoseri pakiwuka ndiri kwa mashi na Rohu Mnanagala, hapeni kingiri Muufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Muntu kiwuka shinshimba kwa tati na mawu, kumbiti yakiwuka shirohu kwa Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nagulikangasha toziya nukugambira mpaka gwiwuki kayi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Liyega ligendaga palifira kugenda, gulipikanira kuvuma kwakuwi, kumbiti guvimana ndiri kwalilawiti ama kwaligenda. Ntambu iraayi, iwera hangu kwa muntu yakiwuka kwa Rohu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu kamkosiya, “Hashi, shitwatila ashi, shiwezikani?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu kamwankula, “Hashi, gwenga guwera mfunda gwa Israeli na guvimana ndiri vitwatira avi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nukugambira nakaka, tutakula galii tugamaniti na tuwera wakapitawu wa galii tugawoniti, su mwenga mjimira ndiri ujumbi wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Mjimira ndiri panuwagambireni vitwatira vya isi ayi, hashi hamjimiri panuwagambireni vitwatira vya kumpindi? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kwahera muntu yakapatiti kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu, ira Mwana gwa Muntu ndo mweni yakalawiti kumpindi kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Gambira Musa ntambu yakamtuliti njoka gwa shaba palusiki kushiwala kulii, ntambu iraayi Mwana gwa Muntu hakanyasulwi kumpindi, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />su kila muntu yakamjimira kawera na ukomu wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Mana Mlungu kawafiriti nentu wantu wa pasipanu, su kamlaviyiti Mwana gwakuwi gwa gweka, su kila yakamjimira hapeni kahowi, kumbiti kaweri na ukomu wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Mlungu kamjegiti ndiri Mwana gwakuwi pasipanu kupatoza, kumbiti kapalopoziyi.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Woseri yawamjimira Mwana hapeni watozwi, kumbiti woseri yawamjimira ndiri watozwa kala, toziya wamjimira ndiri Mwana gwa gweka gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Na toza yeni ndo ayi, gulangala gwiza pasipanu, kumbiti wantu wafiriti ntiti kuliku gulangala, toziya vitendu vyawu vidoda. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Woseri walii yawatenda vidoda wagukalalira gulangala, hapeni wizi muulangala, toziya wafira ndiri vitendu vyawu vimaniki. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Kumbiti woseri yawatenda unakaka wiza mu mulangala, su gulangala guvilangaliri vitendu vyawu vyawavitenda vyakumjimilira Mlungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Shakapanu, Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi kumkowa gwa Yudeya, kalikaliti kuliya pamuhera nawomberi kwa shaka pakabatiza wantu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Viraa Yohani kaweriti kankubatiza wantu kulii Ainoni, pakwegera na Salemu, toziya kulii kuweriti na mashi gamema. Wantu wamgendiriti, nayomberi kaweriti kankuwabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Shaka ashi Yohani hawenimtuli mushibetubetu.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Likakatala lilawiriti pakati pa wafundwa wa Yohani na Myawudi yumu kuusu shitiba sha kunawa ntambu yayifiriwitwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Su wamgenderiti Yohani na kumgambira, “Mfunda, gumuhola muntu uliya yakaweriti pamuhera nagwenga kusika kumwambu kwa Yoridani, ulii gwenga yagumtakuliti? Vinu yomberi kankubatiza na kila muntu kamgendera!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohani kawankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 3:27">“Kwahera muntu yakawera na shintu shoseri, mpaka kapananwi kulawa kumpindi. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Maweni mwenga muweza kutakula galii gantakuliti, ‘Neni na Kristu ndiri, kumbiti wantumiti su numulongoleri.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mpalu gwa ndowa ndo mweni gwa mdala gwa ndowa, su wagolokera ndowa wagolokiti na kupikinira, wanemelera nentu pawapikanira liziwu lya mpalu gwa ndowa. Hangu ndo ntambu ya nemeleriti nentu. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Mweni ndo kendereyi kamanikana ira neni nendereyi kumanikana ndiri.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakiza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yakiza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu ndo mkulu kuliku woseri. Yakalawila pasipanu ndo gwa pasipanu na katakulaga vitwatira vya pasipanu, kumbiti yakiza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu ndo mkulu kuliku woseri. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yomberi kapitawulira galii kagawoniti na kugapikanira, kumbiti kwahera muntu yakaujimilira ujumbi wakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Su muntu yoseri yakajimira ukapitawu wakuwi, katakula weri handa Mlungu ndo gwa nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ulii yakatumitwi na Mlungu kutakula visoweru vya Mlungu, toziya Mlungu kumpanana muntu ayu Rohu Mnanagala pota na shipimu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tati kamfira Mwana gwakuwi na kavitula vintu vyoseri mumawoku mwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yakamjimira Mwana kana ukomu wa mashaka goseri, yakamjimira ndiri Mwana hakaweri ndiri na ukomu, su maya ga Mlungu hagaweri kwakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mdala Msamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayu wapikiniriti handa Yesu kaweriti kankubatiza na kankuwapata wafundwa wavuwa kuliku Yohani. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Kumbiti nakaka Yesu kawera ndiri kankubatiza ira wafundwa wakuwi ndo waweriti wankubatiza. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu pakapikaniriti aga, kalawa Yudeya kagenda Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />pamwanja gwakuwi kalazimika kupitila Samariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Su kasokiti Sikari, lushi lumu lwa Samariya, pakwegera na lirambu lilii Yakobu lyakampananiti mwana gwakuwi Yosefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Na panu paweriti na linegu lya Yakobu. Yesu kaweriti katoka toziya ya mwanja, su kalivagiti pasi pampenku pa linegu. Iweriti ipata saa sita paliwala.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mdala Msamariya kiziti kuteka mashi na Yesu kamgambira, “Gumpanani mashi nandi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi mulushi kuhemera shiboga.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mdala uliya kamgambira, “Gwenga gwa Muyawudi, neni na Msamariya! Su guwezahashi kunduwa mashi ga kulanda?” Wayawudi hapeni watumii lwindi na vibakuli vyavihanganyikiti na vya wantu wa Samariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu kamwankula, “Handa meguvimaniti mafupu ga Mlungu na gaa yakakuluwa mashi ga kulanda, megumluwi na yomberi mekakupi mashi ga ukomu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mdala uliya kalonga, “Mtuwa, gwenga gwahera shintu sha kutekera mashi na linegu ndo litalipa. Su, hagupati koshi mashi gana ukomu? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Mbuyi gwetu Yakobu ndo yakatupiti linegu ali, yomberi na wana wakuwi pamuhera na mifugu yakuwi yoseri walanditi mashi aga. Ashi gwenga gulitumba kuwera mkulu kuliku Yakobu?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu kamwankula, “Woseri walanda mashi aga hawaweri na kwimiluwa kayi. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Kumbiti yoseri yakalanda mashi ganumpanana neni, hapeni kaweri na kwimiluwa kayi. Mashi ganumpanana hagaweri mngati mwakuwi mbwiru ya mashi ga ukomu na kumpanana ukomu wa mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mdala uliya kamgambira, “Mtuwa, gunupi mashi aga! Shakapanu hapeni numuluwi kayi na hapeni nizi kayi panu kuteka mashi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakamshemi mpalu gwaku gwizi nayomberi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mdala uliya kamwankula, “Neni nahera mpalu,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu kamgambira, “Gutakula weri pagutakuliti gwahera mpalu. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Guyugwa na wapalu wamuhanu, yomberi yagulikala nayu vinu, mpalu gwaku ndiri. Gung'ambira nakaka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mdala uliya kamgambira, “Mtuwa, mona gwenga gwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Wambuyi wangu wa Samariya wamguwiriti Mlungu mulugongu alu, su mwenga Wayawudi mlonga kuwera Yerusalemu ndo pahala pa kumguwira Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu kamgambira, “Mdala, gunjimiri, shaka shankwiza ndo sheni wantu hapeni wamguwira Tati mulugongu alu ama ku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mwenga Wasamaliya muvimana ndiri nakaka yawamguwira, kumbiti twenga Wayawudi tumumana yatumguwira, toziya ulopoziya wiza kulawa kwa Wayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kumbiti shaka shankwiza na kayi shisoka kala, peni wawamguwira nakaka, hawamguwili Tati kwa likakala lya Rohu, wantu wamguwira hangu ndo Tati yakawafira. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mlungu ndo Rohu, na wantu hawawezi hera kumguwira nakaka kwa likakala lya Rowu gwakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mdala ulii kamgambira, “Nuvimana kuwera Kristu Mlopoziya yakasyagulitwi hakizi na pakiza hakatugambiri twenga kila shintu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu kamgambira, “Neni, ndo yantakula na gwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Shaka shila shilii wafundwa wa Yesu wawuyiti na waweriti na likangasha likulu pawamwona Yesu pakatakula na mdala. Kwehera yumu pakati pawu yakamgambiriti mdala ulii, “Gufira shishi?” Ama kumkosiya Yesu, “Iwera hashi gwankutakula na mdala ayu?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Su, mdala uliya kaileka vulu yakuwi, kagenda mulushi na kuwagambira wantu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mwizi mloli muntu yakang'ambiriti vitwatira vyoseri vyantenditi. Hashi, iwezikana yomberi kawera Kristu yakasyagulitwi na Mlungu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Wantu walawa mulushi, wamgendera Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Shaka shila shiriya wafundwa waweriti wankumuhiga Yesu, “Mfunda, gulii shiboga!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Su Yesu kawankula, “Neni nana shiboga shamshimana ndiri.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Wafundwa wakuwi walitakuziyana weni, “Hashi, kwana muntu yoseri yakamjegiriti shiboga?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu kawagambira, “Shiboga shaneni ndo kugajimira gakafira ulii yakantumiti neni na kumalira lihengu lyakampananiti kutenda. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mwenga mtakula, ‘Kunkali myezi ya msheshi hera, shaka sha kubenanga hashisoki.’ Su nukugambirani, mloli marambu, viboga vinu vipiya kala na viwera kala kubenanga! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Yakabena viboga kankupata shibenamgongu na kankujojinira viboga kwa mashaka goseri, su yumonga yakayala na ulii yakabena hawanemeleri pamuhera. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kutakula aku kwa nakaka, ‘Yumu kayalaga na yumonga kabenaga.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Neni nuwatumiti mwenga mwakabeni viboga mulirambu mtenda ndiri lihengu, wamonga watenditi lihengu kulii na mwenga mwana mota kulawirana na lihengu lyawatenditi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamariya wavuwa mulushi lulii wamjimiriti Yesu toziya mdala uliya katakuliti, “Kang'ambiriti neni shintu shoseri shantenditi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Su Wasamariya pawamgendiriti Yesu, wamuluwiti yomberi kalikali pamuhera na womberi na Yesu kalikaliti kulii mashaka mawili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Wantu wavuwa wamjimiriti toziya ya ujumbi wakuwi, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />na womberi wamgambira mdala uliya, “Vinu twenga tujimira, toziya ndiri ya shilii shagutakuliti, ira toziya twenga tumpikanira twaweni na tuvimana kuwera nakaka ndo Mlopoziya gwa pasipanu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya mwana gwa afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Pagapititi mashaka mawili, Yesu kawukiti paliya na kugenda Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Mana Yesu mweni katakuliti, “Mbuyi gwa Mlungu hapeni kapananwi ligoya muisi yakuwi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Pakasokiti Galilaya, wantu wa paliya wamshemiriti, toziya pawaweriti mumsambu gwa Pasaka kulii Yerusalemu wawonaga vitwatira vyoseri vyakatenditi Yesu shaka sha msambu.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Su Yesu kawuyiti kayi Kana mumkowa gwa Galilaya, pahala pakagalambuziti mashi kuwera divayi.Ofisa gwa sirikali kaweriti paliya mwana gwakuwi kaweriti kalwala ku Kafarinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Pakapikaniriti handa Yesu kankwiza Galilaya pakalawila Yudeya, kamgendiriti yomberi na kumgambira kagendi Kaferinawumu na kamuponiziyi mwana gwakuwi, yakaweriti sambira kahowa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu kamgambira, “Pamwona ndiri malangaliru na mauzauza, hapeni mjimiri!”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Afisa ulii kamwankula, “Mtuwa, tugendi pamuhera vinu, mwana hakeni howi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu kamgambira, “Gugendi, mwana gwaku hakaweri mkomu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Muntu uliya kavimaniti visoweru vya Yesu, su kagenda zakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Pakaweriti kankali munjira kuwuya ukaya kaliwoniti na wantumintumi wakuwi pawamjegera visoweru, “Muntemba gwakuwi kawera mkomu!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Kawakosiya shaka gaa mwana gwakuwi pakaweriti mkomu na womberi wamwankula, “Iweriti saa saba paliwala lishu nshimba kupyupa paimlekeziyiti.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tati uliya kaliholiti kuwera shaka shiliya ndo Yesu pakamgambiriti, “Mwana gwaku hakaweri mkomu.” Su mweni pamuhera na kaya yakuwi yoseri wamjimira Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Liuzauza ali ndo lya pili lyakatenditi Yesu pakaweriti kankulawa Yudeya na kugenda Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Shakapanu, Yesu kagenditi Yerusalemu kumsambu gwa Wayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Kulaa Yerusalemu, pakwegera na ligomi gwawagushemiti Ligomi lwa kondolu, kweniti na litanda lyawalishemiti kwa Shiebraniya Betizata, liweriti na seemu midamu muhanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Lipinga likulu lya walweli walivagiti seemu azi, wanalwisi na wavibyeketu na yawalewelekiti. Su waweriti wankuhepera mashi gatimbuki, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />toziya ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kulawa kwa Mtuwa kila mala pakiza na kugatimbula mashi. Mlweri gwa kwanja kwingira mumashi pagatimbuka kaponiziwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Paliya paweriti na muntu yumu yakalwaliti kwa shaka sha mivinja malongu mitatu na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu pakamwoniti muntu uliya kagonja paliya na kavimaniti kuwera kalwariti kwa shaka shivuwa, su kamkosiyiti, “Hashi, gufira guponi?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Muntu yakalwala kankula, “Mtuwa, kwahera muntu panu gwankuntula mumashi shaka mashi pagatimbuka. Panjeriti kwingira kumbiti kila mala, muntu yumonga kanongulera.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu kamgambira, “Gugoloki, gutoli lisaga lyaku gugendigendi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Palaa paliya muntu uliya kapona. Kagutoliti lisaga lyakuwi na kanja kugendagenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Shitwatila ashi shitendikiti Mulishaka lya kwoyera. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Wakulu wa Wayawudi pawawoniti muntu ulii yakaponiziwitwi, womberi wamgambira, “Leru ndo lishaka lya kwoyera! Kwahera ulekeziwu kwa gwenga kupapa lisaga lyaku.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Kumbiti Yomberi kawagambira, “Muntu yakamponiziyiti kang'ambiriti ntoli lisaga, ng'ending'endi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nawomberi wamkosiyiti, “Ndo gaa yakakugambiriti gutoli lisaga lyaku na gugendigendi?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Kumbiti yomberi kamumana ndiri muntu yakamuponiziiti, mana Yesu kaweriti kalihanganiya mulipinga lya wantu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Shapakanu Yesu kaliwoniti na muntu yakamponiziyiti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, su kamgambira, “Gupikani vinu gwamkomu, guleki kutenda vidoda ama vitwatira vidoda virawili kwaku.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Shakapanu muntu uliya kagenda, kawagambira wakolamlima wa Shiyawudi kuwera Yesu ndo yakamuponiziiti. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Su Wayawudi wanjiti kumgaziya Yesu, toziya yomberi katenditi shitwatila ashi sha kuponiziya mulishaka lya Kwoyera. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu kawagambira womberi, “Tati gwangu kankutenda lihengu mashaka goseri, naneni viraa ntenda lihengu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Visoweru avi viwatenda wakulu wa Shiyawudi wendereyi kusakula ntambu ya kumlaga Yesu, toziya kalitenda ndiri weri lilagaliru lya lishaka lya Kwoyera na katakuliti kuwera Mlungu ndo Tati gwakuwi na viraa vilii pakalitenda kuwera gambira Mlungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwezu wa Mwana gwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu kawagambiriti womberi, “Nukugambirani nakaka, Mwana kaweza ndiri kutenda shoseri gweka yakuwi, katenda shilii shakawoniti Tati gwakuwi pakatenda. Vilii vyakatendaga Tati, viraa vilii ndo vyakatenda Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Toziya Tati kamfira Mwana na kamlangalira yomberi vyoseri vyakatenditi mweni, viraa vilii hakamlanguzii vitwatira vikulu kuliku avi, mwenga hamlikangashi. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Handa virii Tati pakawazyukisiyiti wahowiti na kuwapanani ukomu, ntambu iraayi Mwana kawapanani ukomu walii yawafira. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tati hapeni katozi muntu yoseri, kumbiti lihengu lyoseri lya kutoza kamupa Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />su wantu woseri wamgohilili Mwana ntambu yawamgohelera Tati. Yakamgohelira ndiri Mwana, kamgohalila ndiri Tati. Tati ndo mweni yakamtumiti Mwana.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Nakugambirani nakaka, woseri yawapikanira visoweru vyangu na kumjimira ulii yakantumiti, hakaweri na ukomu wa mashaka goseri. Hapeni katozwi, ira kapita kala kulawa mukuhowa na kwingira muukomu. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nukugambirani nakaka, shaka shankwiza, kayi shisoka kala, ndo sheni wahowiti hawapikiniri liziwu lya Mwana gwa Mlungu na woseri yawapikanira hawalikali. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Gambira Tati ntambu yakawera shyanziru sha ukomu, hera hangu viraa ntambu yakamtenda Mwana gwakuwi kuwera shyanziru sha ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Na kamupiti Mwana uwezu wa kutoza, toziya yomberi ndo Mwana gwa Muntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Namulikangasha shitwatila ashi, shaka shankwiza yawahowiti woseri hawapikiniri liziwu lyakuwi <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nawomberi hawalawi mumapumba mwawu, woseri walii yawatenditi viherepa hawazyuki na kulikala, na woseri yawatenditi vidoda, hawazyuki na kutozwa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wapitawu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Neni weza ndiri kutenda shoseri kwa uwezu waneni. Neni ntenda hera ntambu ya Mlungu pakang'ambira, su kutoza kwaneni ndo teratera, toziya njeriti ndiri kutenda shirii shanfira, kumbiti ntenda shirii shakafira ulii yakantumiti.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Handa panulitakulila namweni, upitawu wa neni hapeni ujimilwi kuwera wa nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Kumbiti kwana yumonga ndo mweni katakulaga upitawu kuusu neni, naneni nuvimana kuwera vyoseri vyakatakula kuusu neni ndo vyanakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwenga mtumiti ujumbi kwa Yohani, nayomberi kawutakuliti nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Neni nuwutumbira ndiri upitawu wa wantu, kumbiti ntakula vitwatira avi mpati kulopoziwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohani kaweriti gambira lumuliku lwaluweriti lwakuyaka na kulangala na mwenga musekereriti kulangala kwa shaka shididiki hera.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />“Neni nanawu upitawu kuusu namweni ndo weni mkulu mnu kuliku ulii wa Yohani. Shantenda ndo sheni shakung'ambira kuwera Tati ndo yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tati ndo yakantumiti, viraa kananguziya. Mwenga hapeni mpikaniri liziwu lyakuwi ama mwoni sheni shakuwi, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na visoweru vyakuwi hapeni vikali mumyoyu mwenu, toziya mumjimira ndiri ulii yakamtumiti.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />“Mwenga mgalola weri Malembu Mananagala, toziya mulihola kuwera mngati mwakuwi hampati ukomu wa mashaka goseri, kumbiti Malembu galaa galiya gantakula! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Pamuhera na hangu, mwenga mlema kwiza kwaneni mpati ukomu.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ndolera ndiri ukwisa kulawa kwa wantu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Kumbiti nuwamana mwenga, nuvimana kuwera ufiru wa Mlungu kwahera mumyoyu mwenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Neni niza kwa uwezu wa Tati gwangu, su munshemera ndiri, Kumbiti mwenga muwashemeraga wantu pawiza muuwezu wawu. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mfira kuwanka uzyumi kwa wantu, kumbiti mfira ndiri kujera kutenda vitwatira kwa ulii yakawera Mlungu gweka yakuwi, hashi mweza kunjimira neni?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“Namulihola handa neni hanuwasitaki mwenga kwa Tati gwangu. Musa ndo mweni, mwenga mumtumbiriti mweni ndo hakawasitaki. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Handa nakaka mwenga memjimiri Musa, viraa memunjimiri naneni, toziya Musa kalembiti kuusu neni. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Kumbiti mugajimiriti ndiri galii gakalembiti Musa, hamuwezi hashi kuvijimira visoweru vyangu?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulipanana shiboga lipinga likulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Shakapanu, Yesu kalokiti litanda lya Galilaya ama litanda lya Tiberiya <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Lipinga likulu lya wantu limfatiti toziya wantu awa waweriti wawona mauzauza gakuwi ga kuwaponiziya walweli <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu kakweniti mulugongu, kalivaga pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Msambu gwa Wayawudi gwa Pasaka guweriti gwapakwegera. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Su, Yesu kalola wega zoseri na kuwona lipinga likulu lya wantu lyankumwizira, kamkosiya Filipu, “Tuhemeri koshi mabumunda su wantu awa wapati kuliya?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Katakuliti aga kumjera Filipu, kavimaniti kala mweni hakavinyawi.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipu kamwankula, “Mabumunda ga mpiya sha shibenamgongu sha myezi sita hashiwatoshi ndiri wantu awa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Yumu gwa Wafundwa wakuwi yawamshema Andereya, mlongu gwakuwi Simoni Peteru kamgambira, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Panu pana muntemba yumu kawera na mabumunda muhanu na wasomba wawili. Kumbiti avi vitosha ndiri kwa wantu wavuwa handa awa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu katakula, “muwagambirani wantu walivagi pasi.” Paweriti na mahamba pahala palii. Wantu walivagiti. Paweriti wapalu elufu muhanu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu katola mabumunda galii, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kawapanana wantu yawalivagiti pasi. Katenda hangu na wasomba walii. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Wantu pawikutiti Yesu kawagambira Wafundwa wakuwi, wajojaniri vipandi vyavisigaliti, namwasa shintu. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Su, wavitula pamuhera vipandi vyavisigaliti vya mabumunda wavimemiziya mumajamanda lilongu na mbili kulawa kwa mabumunda muhanu galii.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Wantu pawaliwoniti liuzauza ali Yesu lyakalitenditi, watakula, “Nakaka ayu ndo mweni mbuyi gwa Mlungu yakiziti pasipanu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu kavimana handa wantu wafiriti kumtola kwa makakala wamtendi mfalumi, kawukiti kayi kagenditi palugongu gweka yakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankugendagenda pampindi pamashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Payisokiti pamihi, Wafundwa wakuwi wasokiti kulitanda, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Wakwena muuwatu, su waloki kugenda Kafarinaumu. Ntiti iweriti yankwingira na Yesu kaweriti kankali kuwayizira. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Liyega liweriti lyankuvuma na mawimbi ga mashi gaweriti gakutindira. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Wafundwa pawaweriti wankugenda kutali kwa kilumita muhanu ama sita, wamwoniti Yesu kankugendagenda pamashi, kaweriti pakwegera na uwatu, womberi watiriti nentu. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesu kawagambira, “Namtira, ndo neni!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Su womberi wafiriti kumtola Yesu muuwatu na palaa palii uwatu gusokiti muisi pahala pawaweriti wankugenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wankumsakula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Shirawu yakuwi wantu wavuwa wasigaliti uwega gwa pili wa litanda, wavimaniti handa kuweriti na uwatu gumu hera palii. Womberi wavimaniti kuwera Yesu hapeni kagendi na wafundwa wakuwi, kumbiti wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi pawamleka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Miuwatu imonga ilawa Tiberiya isoka pahala lipinga lya wantu pawaliyiti mabumunda, shaka Mtuwa pakalongiti mayagashii Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Su, wantu awa pawavimaniti handa Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi waweriti ndiri pahala paliya, wakwena uwatu umonga wagenda Kafarinaumu pawamsakula.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo libumunda lya Ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Wantu walii pawamwoniti Yesu kumwambu kulitanda wamkosiya, “Mfunda, gwiza ndiri panu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu kankula, “Nakaka nuwagambirani, mwankunsakula ndiri toziya mumaniti weri liuzauza lilii, kumbiti toziya muliyiti mabumunda galii mwikuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Namushitendera lihengu shiboga shashyalibika, kumbiti mushitenderi lihengu shiboga sha ukomu wa mashaka goseri. Ashi ndo shiboga Mwana gwa muntu hakakupanani, toziya Tati Mlungu kamjimira kutenda hangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Womberi wamkosiya, “Tutendi shishi su tutendi vilii vyakafira Mlungu twenga tutendi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu kawankula, “Vintu vyakafira Mlungu ndo mwenga kumjimira ulii yakantumiti.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Wamgambira, “Hagutendi liuzauza gaa su tuloli tupati kukujimira? Hagutendi shintu gaa? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Wazewi wetu waliyiti shiboga shawashishema Mana kushiwala kulii, gambira Malembu galembwa, Kawapananiti libumunda kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nakaka nuwagambirani, Musa kawapananiti ndiri libumunda kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, Tati gwangu ndo mweni kawapanani mwenga libumunda lya nakaka kulawa kumpindi. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Toziya mabumunda ga Mlungu ndo ula ulii kasuluka kulawa kumpindi na kutupanana ukomu wa pasipanu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Su, wamgambira, “Mtuwa, gutupanani kila lishaka libumunda ali.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu kawagambira “Neni ndo libumunda lya ukomu. Walii yawiza kwaneni hawawoni ndiri njala, yakanjimira neni hawawoni ndiri kwimiluwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Nuwagambirani weri kulonga mumona, kumbiti munjimira ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Woseri ndo weni yakanupiti Tati hawizi kwaneni, naneni hapeni numwingi yoseri yakiza kwaneni, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />toziya niza kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu ntendi ndiri vilii vyanfira. Niza kutenda vilii vyakafira ulii yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Uliya yakantumiti kafira aga, nanimwamizili yumu pakati pa walii yakampananiti, ira hanuwazyukusiyi woseri lishaka lya upeleru. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Mana shakafira Tati gwangu ndo ashi, kila yakamwona Mwana na kumjimira kawera na ukomu wa mashaka goseri. Neni hanuwazyukusiyi lishaka lya upeleru.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Su Wayawudi wanjiti kuhinginika kuusu yomberi toziya Yesu katakuliti, “Neni ndo libumunda lilawiti kupindi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Su womberi watakula, “Hashi, ayu Yesu ndiri mwana gwa Yosefu? Tumumana tati gwakuwi na mawu gwakuwi! Su, kaweza hashi kutakula kalawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mleki kuhinginika mwenga kwa mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kwahera muntu kawezi kwiza kwaneni mpaka Tati yakantumiti pakamjega kwaneni, naneni hanumzyukisiyi muntu ayu ku ukomu lishaka lya upeleru. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Wambuyi wa Mlungu walembiti, ‘Wantu woseri hawafundwi na Mlungu.’ Kila muntu yakampikanira Tati na kulifunda kwa yomberi kizi kwaneni.<verse eid="JHN 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />“Ayi yahera mana handa kamlamu muntu yakamwoniti Tati, payiweri ndiri ulii yakalawiti kwa Mlungu, ulii ndo yomberi yakamwoniti Tati. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nunkugambirani nakaka, yakanjimira kana ukomu wa mashaka goseri.<verse eid="JHN 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />“Neni nalibumunda lya ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Wambuyi wenu waliyiti mana kushiwala kulii, kumbiti wahowiti. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Kumbiti libumunda lyalilawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu su muntu yoseri yakaliya hapeni kahowi. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Neni nalibumunda likomu lyalisulukiti kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Muntu yoseri yakaliya libumunda ali hakalikali mashaka goseri. Na libumunda lyanumupa yomberi ndo nshimba yaneni, yanuilaviya su wantu wa pasipanu waweri na ukomu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Shapakanu Wayawudi wanjiti kulitakuliziyana nentu pakati pawu, “Kaweza hashi muntu ayu kutupanana nshimba yakuwi, tuliyi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nankuwagambirani nakaka, pamuliya ndiri nshimba ya Mwana gwa Muntu na kulanda ndiri mwazi gwakuwi, hapeni muweri na ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Yakaliya nshimba yaneni na kulanda mwazi gwangu kanawu ukomu wa mashaka goseri, naneni hanumzyukusiyi lishaka lya kupelera. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Toziya nshimba yaneni ndo shiboga sha nakaka na mwazi gwangu ndo shilandiru sha nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yakaliya nshimba yaneni na kulanda mwazi gwangu, hakalikali mngati mwangu, naneni nulikali mngati mwakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 6:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />“Tati yakawera mkomu yakantumiti neni, toziya naneni nulikala viraa. Ntambu iraayi yoseri yakandiya neni hakalikali toziya yaneni. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Su, ali ndo libumunda lisulukiti kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, handa ndiri libumunda lyawaliyiti wambuyi wenu. Pawaliyiti kala wahowiti, kumbiti wantu woseri wawaliya libumunda ali hawaweri na ukomu wa mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu katakuliti aga pakaweriti kankufunda munumba ya Mlungu kulii Kafarinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Visoweru vya ukomu wa mashaka goseri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Su wantu wavuwa wafundwa wakuwi pawapikaniriti aga watakula, “Aga ndo mafundu gakamala! Gani kaweza kugapikanira?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu kavimaniti pota nakugambirwa na muntu, kulonga wafundwa wakuwi waweriti wankuhiginika kuusu shitwatila ashi, su kawakosiiti, “Hashi, shitwatila ashi shiwatenda muweri ndiri na nakaka? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Haiweri hashi pamumwona Mwana gwa Muntu pakakwena kugenda pahala palii pakaweriti pakwanjira? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Rohu gwa Mlungu ndo yakajega ukomu, nshimba ya muntu hapeni iwezi. Visoweru vyanuwagambirani ndo vya Rohu yakajega ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ata hangu wamonga wenu wajimira ndiri.” Yesu kavimaniti kwanjira pakwanjira walii yawajimira ndiri, viraa ndo gaa hakamgalambuki. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Yesu kongeriti kutakula kayi, “Ayi ndo toziya nuwagambiriti kulonga kwahera muntu yakaweza kwiza kwaneni pakawezeshwa ndiri na Tati gwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Toziya ya aga, wamonga wavuwa wafundwa wa Yesu wawuyiti na waleka kumfata kayi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Su, Yesu kawakosiiti wantumintumi walii lilongu na mbili, “Hashi, mwenga, mfira kuwuya kwenu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Peteru kamwankula, “Mtuwa, tugendi kwa gaa? Gwenga gwana visoweru vya ukomu wa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Twenga tujimira vinu na tuvimana gwenga gwa Mnanagala yakiza kulawa kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu kawankula, “Hashi nuwasyagula ndiri mwenga lilongu na mbili? Ata hangu, yumu gwenu ndo Shetani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu katakuliti aga kuusu Yuda, mwana gwa Simoni Isikariyoti, Yuda kaweriti yumu gwa wafundwa wakuwi kumbiti ndo hakamgalambuki Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na walongu wakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Pa aga, Yesu kaweriti kankugendagenda kulaa ku Galilaya. Kafiriti ndiri kugendagenda kumkowa wa Yudeya toziya wakulu wa Wayawudi waweriti wankufira kumlaga. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Shaka sha msambu gwa Wayawudi gwa visasa guweriti gwapakwegera. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Su, walongu wakuwi wamgambira, “Guwuki panu gugendi Yudeya, su wafundwa waku wawoni vitwatira vyagutenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Muntu katenda ndiri vitwatira kwa kubada pakafira kamanikani kwa wantu. Toziya gutenda vitwatira avi, guleki wantu wa pasipanu poseri wavimani kuusu gwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ata walongu wakuwi wamjimira ndiri.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu kawagambira, “Shaka shangu shashifaa shankali kusoka. Mwenga kila shaka shifaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Wantu wa pasipanu hapeni wizi kuwakalalira mwenga, neni wankalalira toziya neni ntakula kwawu kuwera matendu gakuwi gadoda. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mwenga mgendi kumsambu. Neni hapeni ng'endi ku msambu aku vinu, toziya saa yaneni yaifaa yankali kusoka.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Katakuliti aga, shakapanu kendereyiti kulikala Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na walongu wakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Walongu wakuwi pawagenditi kala kumsambu, Yesu kagenditi viraa, kumbiti kagenditi ndiri pawamlola ira kagenditi kwa kulififa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Wakulu wa Wayawudi waweriti wankumsakula ku msambu aku. Womberi wakosiya, “Ka koshi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kuweriti mapwepweziyu nentu kuusu Yesu mulipinga lya wantu. Wamonga watakuliti, “Yesu ndo muntu muheri.” Na wamonga watakuliti, “Ndala! Kankuwapayira wantu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakatakuliti kuusu Yesu paweru, toziya waweriti wankuwatira wakulu wa Shiyawudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Msambu agu pagusokiti pakati na kumalirika, Yesu pakagenditi Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kanjiti kufunda. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Wakulu wa Shiyawudi walikangashiti nentu, walongiti, “Iwera hashi muntu ayu kerewa nentu, nayomberi kagenditi ndiri kushuli?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu kawankula, “Shilii shanfunda shilawa kwaneni ndiri, ira shilawa kwa Mlungu, ndo mweni yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Muntu yakafira kutenda galii gagafira Mlungu, haguvimani handa mafundu gangu galawa kwa Mlungu, ama neni nfunda kwa uwezu wangu namweni. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Muntu yakatakula kwa uwezu wakuwi mweni, kankusakula uzyumi wakuwi mweni. Kumbiti ulii yakasakula uzyumi wa ulii yakantumiti, ayu ndo mwaminika na mngati mwakuwi kwahera ufyangu woseri. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Hashi, Musa kakupanana ndiri Lilagaliru? Ata hangu, kwahera ata yumu gwenu yakalijimila Lilagaliru. Hashi, mfira mndagi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Lipinga lya wantu limwankula, “Gwenga gwana shamshera! Gani kafira kukulaga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu kawankula, “Kwana liuzauza limu lyantenditi, namwenga mlikangashiti. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa kawalagaliriti mwenga muwayingiziyi jandu wana wenu, shitiba ashi sha Musa ndiri ira wambuyi wenu ndo wanjiti kushitenda shitiba ashi na mumwingiziya jandu mwana mulishaka lya Kwoyera. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Handa pamumwingiziya mwana jandu mulishaka lya Kwoyera su mleka ndiri Lilagaliru lya Musa, iwera hashi munkalalira neni toziya numponiziya muntu mulishaka lya Kwoyera? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mleki kutoza kwa kunja hera, mtozi kwa shipimu sha teratera.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hashi, ayu ndo Kristu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Wantu wamu wa Yerusalemu watakuliti, “Ndo ayu ndiri, muntu yawamsakula wamlagi? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mloli! Kawagambira pota na kufifa, womberi watakula ndiri shintu shoseri kuusu yomberi! Hashi, iwezekana kuwera wakulu wavimana nakaka kuwera muntu ayu ndo Kristu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kumbiti Kristu pakaweriti kankwiza, kwahera muntu yoseri yakavimaniti kuwera Kristu hakalawili koshi, kumbiti tuvimana kuwera muntu ayu kwakalawira!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu pakaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, yomberi katakuliti kwa liziwu, “Mumana neni na muvimana kwandawa? Niza ndiri kwa uwezu wangu mweni. Ulii yakantumiti ndo mwaminika nentu, mwenga mumana ndiri, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Kumbiti neni numumana, toziya ndawa kwakuwi, ndo mweni yakantumiti.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Womberi wafiliti kumkamula Yesu, kumbiti kwahera muntu yakaweza kumkamula yomberi toziya saa yakuwi yankali kusoka. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Wantu wavuwa mulipinga wamjimiriti na walonga, “Kristu pakiza hakatendi mauzauza nentu kuliku aga gakatenditi muntu ayu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanjagira wawatuma kumkamula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayu wapikiniriti wantu pawapwepa visoweru avi kuusu Yesu. Su womberi pamuhera na watambika wakulu wa Numba ya Mlungu wawatumiti wanjagila wamkamuli Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu katakula, “Nankali namwenga kwa shaka shididini, su hanumugenderi ulii yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Hamunsakuli kumbiti hapeni mumoni, toziya hapeni mwizi pahala palii pawera.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Wakulu wa Shiyawudi walitakuziana weni, “Muntu ayu hakagendi koshi ndo peni hapeni tumpati? Hakagendi kwa lushi zya Wagiriki ndo peni wantu wetu Wayawudi pawalikala na hakawafundi Wagiriki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Kamanisha shishi pakatakula, ‘Hatumsakuli kumbiti hapeni tumwoni na palii pahala pakawera hapeni tuwezi kusoka?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nshemba zya mashi gana ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Lishaka lya upeleru lya msambu agu liweriti lishaka likulu. Yesu kagolokiti na kutakula kwa liziwu likulu, “Yakayumuluwa, kizi kwaneni, <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />na yoseri yakanjimira neni kalandi. Gambira Malembu Mananagala ntambu yagalembwa, ‘Yakanjimira neni lushemba lwa mashi ga ukomu haganyiririki kulawa mumoyu mwakuwi.’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu katakuliti aga kuusu Rohu, ndo mweni yawamjimira yomberi hawamuwanki. Shaka shilii, Rohu Mnanagala kaweriti kankali kusoka toziya Yesu kaweriti kankali kukwisuwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulekanira pakati pa wantu kuusu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Wantu wamu pakati pa lipinga lilii wapikiniriti visoweru avi, watakula, “Nakaka muntu ayu ndo ulii mbuyi gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Wamonga watakula, “Ayu ndo Kristu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Kumbiti wamonga watakuliti, “Kristu hapeni kizi kulawa ku Galilaya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Malembu Mananagala galembwiti hangu kuwera Kristu hakaweri mushiyiwuku sha Mfalumi Dawudi na hakayiwuki ku Betirehemu, lushi lyakalikaliti Dawudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Su, kulawiriti malekaniru kuusu yomberi pakati palipinga lilii lya wantu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wantu wamu wafiriti kumbata Yesu, kumbiti kwahera yakajeriti kumbata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa Shiyawudi wahera njimiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Wanjagila pawawuyiti kwa Watambika wakulu na Mafalisayu, womberi wawakosiya, “Iwera hashi mumjega ndiri Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wanjagila wawankula, “Kwahera muntu yakapatiti nakamu kutakula gambira muntu ayu ntambu yakatakuliti!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayu wawakosiya, “Hashi na mwenga wakuzyangani viraa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Hashi, muwoniti kala yumu gwa wakulu wa wantu, ama yumu gwa Mafalisayu yakamjimiriti? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Lipinga ali lya wantu livimana ndiri Lilagaliru lya Musa, lipangirwa!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Yumu gwa Mafalisayu kaweriti Nikodemu ndo mweni pakwanjira paliya kamgenderiti Yesu. Su, kawagambiriti womberi, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Lilagaliru lyetu liweza ndiri kumtoza muntu pamberi pa kumpikinira kwanja na kuvimana shakatenda”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Womberi wamwankula, “Hashi, gwenga viraa gulawira Galilaya? Su kagabetuli Malembu Mananagala, nagwenga haguwoni kuwera Galilaya hapeni kalawiri mbuyi gwa Mlungu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kila muntu kagenditi ukaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mdala muhumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu kagenditi kulugongu lwa Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Shirawu yakuwi mandawira putiputi kagenditi kayi Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Wantu woseri wamgendera, nayomberi kalivaga kanja kufunda. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wafunda wa malagaliru na Mafalisayu wamjegera mdala yumu yawambatiti ugoni pakahumba. Wamgolusiya pakati pawu. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Wamkosia, “Mfunda! Mdala ayu yawambatiti uhumba kaweriti kankuhumba. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Malagaliru ga Musa katulagalira mdala handa ayu wamgumi mabuhi. Su, gwenga gutakula hashi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Watakuliti hangu kwa kumjera Yesu, wapati shanzu sha kumsitaki. Yesu kasuntama, kalemba mlitapaka kwa shyala.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pawawongiriti kumkosiya, Yesu kagolokiti, kawagambira “Muntu yakahera vidoda pakati penu kaweri gwa kwanja kumguma libuwi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Shakapanu kasuntamala kayi, kaweriti kankulemba mulitapaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Pawapikaniriti avi, wanja kuwuka yumuyumu, pawalongolera wazewi. Yesu kasigala gweka yakuwi na mdala ulii kagoloka palaa palii. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu kaligolosiya kamkosiyiti mdala ayu, “Wakoshi wantu walii? Hashi kwahera hata yumu yakakutoziti?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />“Kwahera hata yumu!” Mdala, kamwankula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu kamgambira, “Iherepa, wala neni hapeni nukutozi. Gugendi zyaku na kwanjira vinu nagutenda vidoda kayi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ulangala wa pasipanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu pakayowiriti kayi na Mafalisayu, kawagambira, “Neni ndo ulangala wa pasipanu, yakanizira neni hapeni kagendigendi muntiti nakamu, su hakaweri na Uweru wa ukomu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Su, Mafalisayu wamgambira, “Gwenga gulilanguziya gumweni, su upitawu waku ufaa ndiri.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu kawankula, “Hangu ndiri, ata handa nulilanguziya namweni, upitawu wa neni ndo wa nakaka toziya neni nuvimana kwandawiti na kwang'enda. Kumbiti mwenga muvimana ndiri kwandawiti wala kwang'enda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mwenga muntoza kwa maholu ga wantu, kumbiti neni ntoza ndiri muntu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ata pantoza, kutoza kwaneni ndo kwa nakaka toziya neni nagweka yangu ndiri Tati yakantumiti neni ndo kapamuhera na neni. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ilembitwi Mumalagaliru genu kwa upitawu wa wantu wawili, shintu shoseri shatutakuliti ndo nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Neni nankulilanguziya namweni na Tati yakantumiti, kankunanguziya neni viraa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Wamkosiya, “Tati gwaku ka koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga mumana ndiri neni wala mummana ndiri Tati. Handa memumaniti neni, memumaniti Tati gwangu viraa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu katakuliti visoweru vyoseri avi kaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu pakwegera na lisanduku lya luhanja palitulitwi, Kwahera muntu yakambatiti, toziya saa yakuwi iweriti hayenisoki.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hapeni mwizi kwang'enda neni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu kawagambira kayi, “Hang'endi zyangu, mwenga hamunsakuli, kumbiti hamuhowi muvidoda vyenu. Kwang'enda neni, mwenga hapeni mwezi kusoka.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Su, wakulu wa Shiyawudi watakula, “Hashi, iwera na mana hakalilagi mweni? Iwera hashi kalonga, kwang'enda neni mwenga hapeni msoki?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga mlawa palaa pasipanu, neni ndawa kumpindi, mwenga ndo mwa wa pasipanu, neni hapeni weri gwa pasipanu. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ayi ndo mana nuwagambireni hamhowi muvidoda vyenu. Na hamhowi muvidoda vyenu handa pamjimira ndiri ‘Neni ndo mweni’.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nawomberi wamkosiya, “Gwenga gwa gaa?” Yesu kawankula, “Neni ndo handa vilii nuwagambireni kwanjira kwanja! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nana gavuwa ga kutakula kwa mwenga na vya kuwatoza. Kumbiti uliya yakantumiti ndo nakaka, naneni nuwagambira wantu wa pasipanu shitwatira shampikiniriti kulawa kwakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Wavimana ndiri handa Yesu kaweriti pakatakula nawomberi kumuwusu Tati. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Su, Yesu kawagambira, “pammalira kala kumubikula Mwana gwa Muntu, panu ndo pamfira kumana handa ‘Neni Ndo mweni’, na handa ntenda ndiri shoseri namweni neni, ira ntakula hera galii Tati gakafunditi. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yakantumiti kapamuhera naneni, yomberi kandeka ndiri gweka yangu, toziya mashaka goseri ntenditi galii yagamfiriziya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Wantu wavuwa wampikiniriti Yesu vyakatakuliti wamjimiriti.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unakaka awu hawuwalekeziyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu kawagambira Wayawudi walii yawamjimiriti, “Handa pamgajimila mafundu gangu hamuweri wafundwa wangu nakaka, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />hamuumani unakaka na unakaka hawuwapanani ulekeziwu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nawomberi wamwankula, “Twenga ndo washiyuwuku sha Aburahamu, na hatwenipati ng'o kuwera wamanda wa muntu yoseri. Gwana mana gaa kutakula, ‘Hamuweri walekiziwa?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu kawankula, “Nakaka nuwagambireni, kila muntu yakatenda vidoda ndo mmanda gwa vidoda. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mmanda hapeni kalikali ukaya kwa mtuwa gwakuwi pamashaka goseri, kumbiti mwana kalikala ukaya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mwana pakawapanana ulekeziwu, hamuweri walekiziwa nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nuvimana handa mwenga ndo washiyuwuku sha Aburahamu. Ata hangu, mfira kundaga kwa toziya hamjimili ndiri mafundu gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Neni ntakula galii yakananguziyiti Tati, kumbiti mwenga mtenda galii yakawagambireni Tati gwenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Womberi wamwankula, “Twenga ndo twawana wa Aburahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu kawagambira, “Handa mwenga mwawana wa Aburahamu, memulitendi lihengu lyakatenditi Aburahamu, <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />vyoseri avi vyantenditi nuwagambireni unakaka mpikaniriti kulawa kwa Mlungu, ata hangu, mwenga mfira kundaga. Aburahamu katenda hangu ndiri! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwenga mtenda shitwatira shiraa shilii shakatenditi Tati gwenu.” Womberi wamgambira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">“Mlungu mweni ndo Tati gwetu, twenga twawana ndiri wa kunja.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu kawagambira, handa Mlungu mekaweriti Tati gwenu, menfiri neni, toziya neni ndawiti kwa Mlungu na vinu napanu. Niza ndiri kwa uwezu wangu namweni, ira yomberi kantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Hashi mwerewa ndiri gantakula aga? Ayi ndo toziya mweza ndiri kuwupikanira ujumbi waneni. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mwenga ndo mwawana wa tati gwenu, Shetani na mfira hera kutenda lumatamata lwa tati gwenu. Yomberi kaweriti mlaga kwanjira kwanja, kahera msimamu gwa nakaka, tembera nakaka kwahera mngati mwakuwi. Kila mpayu, zitakulwa kulawirirana na ntambu yakuwi ya munshimba, yomberi ndo mpayu na tati gwa mpayu. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kumbiti neni nukugambirani nakaka, toziya ayi munjimira ndiri neni. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Gani pakati penu yakaweza kulanguziya weri neni nana vidoda? Handa panuwagambira nakaka, iwera hashi munjimira ndiri? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yakalawa kwa Mlungu kapikaniraga visoweru vya Mlungu. Mwenga, mlawa ndiri kwa Mlungu, na ayi ndo toziya mwenga mpikanira ndiri.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayawudi wamkosiya Yesu, “Hashi, hapeni tutakuli nakaka handa gwenga ndo Msamariya na kayi gwana shamshera?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu kawankula, “Neni nahera shamshera, neni numpanana ligoya Tati gwangu, kumbiti mwenga mumpanana ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Neni nsakula ndiri ligoya lyangu namweni, kumbiti kwana yumu mweni kankusakula ligoya ali, nayomberi ndo mtoza. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Nakaka nuwagambireni, yakagakola mafundu gangu hapeni kahowi mashaka goseri!”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Su, Wayawudi wamgambira, “Vinu tuvimana nakaka handa gwenga gwana washamshera! Aburahamu kahowiti na wambuyi wa Mlungu viraa wahowiti, nagwenga gutakula eti, ‘Yakajimira ujumbi waku hakalikali mashaka goseri!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Tati gwetu Aburahamu kahowa, hashi gulitenda gwamkulu kuliku tati gwetu Aburahamu, ndo gwenga? Ata wambuyi wa Mlungu wahowiti. Hashi gwenga gulitenda gwa gaa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu kawankula, “Panilikwisa namweni, ulangara wangu shintu ndiri. Yumu yakankwisa ndo Tati gwangu, kila muntu katakula Mlungu gwetu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Mwenga hapeni mpati kumumana, kumbiti neni numumana. Na, pantankula numumana ndiri, haweri mpayu gambira mwenga. Kumbiti neni nummana na njimira shisoweru shakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tati gwetu Aburahamu, kanemeleriti pakaliwoni lishaka lyangu na yomberi kaliwoniti, kanemelera.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Su, Wayawudi wamgambira, “Gwenga gwankali kusoka vinja lilongu muhanu, nagwenga gumwona Aburahamu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nakaka nuwagambirani, pamberi Aburahamu hakeniyuwuki, neni wera.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Panu wasola mabuwi wamgumangi yomberi, kumbiti Yesu kalififa, kalawa Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumponiziya muntu yakwiwukiti lwisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu pakaweriti kankupita, kamwoniti muntu yumu kana lwisi kwanjira kwiwuka. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiya, “Mfunda! Hashi, gaa ndo yakatenda vidoda vyavimtenda muntu ayu kayiwuki pakawera lwisi? Hashi, vidoda vyakuwi mweni ama vidoda vya walera wakuwi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu kawankula, “Shitwatira ashi shilawira ndiri toziya ya vidoda vyakuwi yomberi, ama vidoda vya walelwa wakuwi, ira kiwuka lwisi su makakala ga Mlungu gawonikani gatenda lihengu mwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Kuweri kwankali paliwala tufiruwa kwendeleya kutenda lihengu lya ulii yakantumiti, mana pashiru peni pankwiza muntu hapeni kawezi kutenda lihengu. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Shaka nankali pasipanu, neni ndo gulangala gwa pasipanu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Pakatakuliti kala aga, katema mata pasi, kalitenda linkandiga, kamswagaziya mumasu ulii yakawera na lwisi, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />kamgambira, “Gugendi na gwakalifyankuli palitanda lya Silowamu.” Mana ya litawu ali ndo “Yawamtumiti”. Muntu kana lwisi ulii kagenda na kulifyankula kulitanda lya Siloamu, shakapanu kawuya pakawera kankuwona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Su, wapakwegera wakuwi na walii yawaweriti wavimana handa kaweriti muhushu mluwa, walonga, “Hashi, ayu ndiri ulii muhushu yakaweriti pakalivaga na kuluwa luwa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamonga pawatakula, “Ndomweni.” Wantu wamu watakula, “ndala! Ira kalifana nayomberi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ulii yakaweriti lwisi katakula, “Ndo neni!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Wamkosiya, “Vinu, masu gakuwi gapata hashi kutumula?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nayomberi kawankula, “Muntu ulii yawamshema Yesu katenditi linkandiga, kaswagaziya mumasu na kung'ambira, ‘Gugendi gwakalifyankuli palitanda lya Silowamu,’ su neni ng'enda, nulifyankula sheni shangu, mpata kwona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wamkosiya, “Yomberi ka koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Nayomberi kawankula, “Neni nuvimana ndiri!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayu wasakula kuvimana vyavilawiliti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Shakapanu wamjega muntu ulii yakaweriti kana lwisi kwa Mafalisayu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Lishaka ali Yesu pakatenditi linkandiga na kumtumuziya masu muntu ayu, iweriti Lishaka lya kwoyera. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Mafalisayu wamkosiya kayi muntu ayu, “Gupata hashi kwona?” Nayomberi kawagambira, “Kantyeremeka linkandiga mumasu, naneni nulifyankula sheni shangu, vinu weza kwona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayu wamu walonga, “Muntu kantenditi hangu hapeni kalawi kwa Mlungu, toziya kajimira ndiri malagaliru ga Lishaka lya kwoyera.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Kumbiti wamonga walonga, “Muntu kana vidoda kaweza hashi kutenda liuzauza lya ntambu ayi?” Kuweriti na malekaniru pakati pawu.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Mafalisayu wamkosiya kayi muntu ayu, “Yomberi kagagubutula masu, gutakula shishi kwa yomberi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Muntu ulii kawagambira, “Yomberi ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Wakulu wa Shiyawudi wajimira ndiri handa muntu ayu kaweriti lwisi na vinu kankuwona mpaka pawawashemiti walera wakuwi <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />na wawakosiya walera awa, “Hashi, ayu mwana gwenu ndo mwenga mlonga kiwukiti lwisi? Hashi vinu kapata kwona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Walera wakuwi wankula, “Tuvimana handa ayu ndo mwana gwetu na kiwukiti lwisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Kumbiti kapata hashi kwona, hapeni tuvimani na wala tuvimana ndiri ulii yakamtumuziyiti masu. Mumkosiyi mweni, yomberi ndo muntu mkulu, kaweza kulitakulira mweni.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Walera wakuwi walongiti hangu toziya wawatiriti wakolamlima wa Shiyawudi, kwani wakolamlima awa waweriti wajimillirana kuwera muntu yoseri yakamini handa Yesu ndo Kristu kalivagi kunja kwa numba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Walelwa wakuwi walongiti, “Yomberi ndo muntu mkulu, Mumkosiyi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Su, wamshema kayi muntu ulii yakiwukiti lwisi na wamgambira, “Gumpanani ukwisa Mlungu! Twenga tuvimana kuwera muntu ayu ndo kana vidoda.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Yomberi kankula, “Handa kawera na vidoda, neni nuvimana ndiri. Kumbiti shintu shimu nushimana, weriti lwisi na vinu mona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Wamkosiya, “Kakutenderiti shishi? Hashi kakutumuliziya masu gaku?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Muntu ayu kawankula, “Nuwagambireni mbera kala, namwenga mpikanira ndiri, mfira shishi kupikinira kayi? Hashi mwenga viraa mfira muweri wafundwa wakuwi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Kumbiti womberi wamwigila pawatakula, “Gwenga ndo mfundwa gwakuwi, twenga wafundwa wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Twega tuvimana handa Mlungu katakuliti na Musa, kumbiti muntu ayu tummana ndiri kalawira koshi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Muntu ulii kawankula, “Ashi ndo shitwatira sha kulikangasha! Mwenga muvimana ndiri kalawira koshi, kumbiti kantumuliziya masu gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tuvimana handa Mlungu hapeni kawapikaniri wantu yawawera na vidoda, ira kampikanira yoseri yakamjimira na kutenda vyakafiriti. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kwanjira lupaga pasipanu ipikanirika ndiri handa muntu kagatumuziya masu ga muntu yakayiwukiti lwisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Payiwera muntu ayu kalawa ndiri kwa Mlungu, mekaweziti ndiri kutenda shintu shoseri!”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Womberi wamwankula, “Gwenga gwiwuka na kulelwa pavidoda, na hashi guweza kutufunda twenga?” Wamuwinga kulawa Mnumba ya Mlungu.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwisi lwa shirohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu kapikaniriti yagalawiliti, kamwoniti muntu ulii kamkosiya, “Hashi, gwenga gumjimira Mwana gwa Muntu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Muntu ayu kawankula, “Mtuwa, gung'ambiri yomberi ndo gaa, su mpati kumjimira!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu kamgambira, “Gumwona kala na yomberi ndo yakatakula nagwenga vinu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Muntu ayu katakula, “Nukujimira, Mtuwa!” Na kamsuntamilira Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu katakula, “Neni niza pasipanu kutoza wantu, wanalwisi wapati kuwona na woseri yawalola waweri lwisi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayu wamu waweriti pamuhera na yomberi wampikanira pakatakuriti aga na wamkosiya, “Gumaanisha natwenga twanalwisi viraa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu kawankula, “Memuweri lwisi, memuweri ndiri na vidoda, kumbiti mwenga vinu mtakula, twenga tuwona, ayi ilanguziya kuwera mwana vidoda.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mlolera muheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Yesu kawagambira, yoseri yakingira ndiri mulizizi lya kondolu kwa kupitira ligomi , ira kapena na kwingira kwa njira yimonga, ayu ndo mwivi na mkwepula. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Muntu yakingira kwa kupitira paligomi, ayu ndo mweni mlolera gwa kondolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mlolera ligomi kamvugulira yomberi, kondolu wapikanira liziwu lyakuwi, nayomberi kawashema kondolu wakuwi kila yumu kwa litawu lyakuwi na kuwalonguziya kunja. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Pakawalaviya kunja, yomberi kawalongolera kulongolu, na wakondolu wamfata, tembera walimana liziwu lyakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Wakondolu awa hapeni wawezi kumfata muntu gwingi, ira hawatugi toziya walimana ndiri liziwu lyakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu kawagambiriti mfanu agu, kumbiti womberi wavimana ndiri shakafiriti kuwagambira.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo Mlolera Muheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Su, Yesu katakula kayi, “Nakaka nuwagambireni, neni ndo ligomi lya kondolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wamonga woseri walii wiziti pamberi pa neni ndo wivi na wakwepula, kumbiti kondolu wawapikinira ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Neni ndo ligomi . Yakingira kupitira neni hakalopoziwi, hakingiri na kulawa na hakapati maliziwu. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwivi kizaga su kiwi na kalagi na kahalabisiyi. Neni niza mpati kuwera na ukomu, ukomu ukamilika.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Neni ndo mlolera muheri. Mlolera muheri kalaviyaga ukomu wakuwi kwa kondolu wakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Muntu gwa shibenamgongu, yomberi mlolera ndiri na wakondolu wakuwi ndiri, pakamuwona liminyi kankwiza, kaleka wakondolu na kutuga, mminyi kawabata wakondolu na kuwapalasiya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Muntu gwa shibenamgongu katuga toziya yomberi gwa shibenamgongu hera, hapeni kawaloleri wakondolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Neni ndo mlolera muheri. Nuwamana wakondolu wangu nawomberi wamana neni, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />gambira Tati ntambu yakamana neni, naneni ntambu yanummana Tati. Neni ndaviya ukomu wangu kwajili ya womberi. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nana wakondolu wamonga yawaweriti ndiri mulizizi ali. Inazimu kuwajega viraa, womberi hawalipikaniri liziwu lya neni, na hakuweri shipinga shimu na mlolera yumu.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Tati kanfira neni toziya ndaviya ukomu wangu, su mpati kuwuwanka kayi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kwahera muntu yakampoka ukomu wangu, neni nuwulaviya mweni. Nana uwezu wa kuwulaviya na kuwutola kayi. Hangu ndo Tati kanagaliriti ntendi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kuwera kayi na malekaniru pakati pa Wayawudi toziya ya visoweru avi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Wantu wavuwa watakuliti, “Kana shamshera, kayi kanalukwali! Gwa shishi kumpikanira?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Wamonga walonga, “Shisoweru ashi sha muntu kana shamshera ndiri. Shamshera kaweza ashi kuponiziya muntu kana lwisi?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulemuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Aku Yerusalemu kuweriti na msambu gwa kumlavilira Mlungu, Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, shaka ashi shiweriti sha mpepu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu kaweriti kankugendagenda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu pahala wapashemiti Mdamu gwa Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Su, Wayawudi wamzyengeta Yesu, wamkosiya, “Hagutuleki pota na kumana mpaka ndii? Gutugambiri nakaka pota kufifa, Hashi, gwenga ndo Kristu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu kawankula, “Nuwagambireni kala, kumbiti munjimira ndiri. Lihengu lyantenda neni kwa uwezu wa Tati gwangu, lwakunanguziya. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Kumbiti mwenga mnjimira ndiri toziya mwenga mwa kondolu wa neni ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Wakondolu wangu wapikinira liziwu lyangu, neni nuwamana, nawomberi wanfati. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Neni nuwayupa ukomu wa mashaka goseri, nawomberi hapeni wahowi. Kwahera muntu yakaweza kuwawusiya mmawoku mwangu <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tati gwangu ndo mweni yakampananiti hawa nayomberi ndo mkulu kuliku woseri. Kwahera yakaweza kuwawusiya mmawoku mwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Neni na Tati, twayumu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Su, Wayawudi watola mabuwi wamgumi. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nuwalanguziyeni mahengu gavuwa kulawa kwa Tati. Nuwatendera shishi shamfira kung'uma na mabuwi?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayawudi wamwankula, “Hapeni tukugumi kwajili ya matendu maheri, kumbiti kwa kumwigilanga Mlungu! Gwenga ndo muntu hera kumbiti mweni gwenga gulitenda kuwera Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu kawankula, “Walembiti Mumalagaliru genu, Neni nonga, ‘mwenga ndo milungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Mlungu kawashemiti milungu walii wawapanana ujumbi wakuwi, natwenga tuvimana handa Malembu Mananagala gatakula nakaka mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Kumbiti neni, Tati ndo kansyaguliti na kantumiti pasipanu. Iwera ashi mung'ambira neni nigilanga toziya ntakuliti ‘Neni Namwana gwa Mlungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Namunjimira neni, pamwona ntenda ndiri vitwatira vya Tati gwangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Kumbiti pantenda vitwatira avi, ata pamunjimira ndiri neni, muvijimiri ata vitwatira vyantenda, su mpati kuvimana nakaka kulonga Tati ka mngati mwangu na neni namngati mwa Tati.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Wajeriti kayi kumbata Yesu kumbiti kawukiti pakati pawu.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu kagenda kayi kumwambu ku lushemba Yoridani, pahala Yohani pakaweriti kankubatiza, kalikaliti aku. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Wantu wavuwa wamgenderiti pawalonga, “Yohani katenda ndiri liuzauza lyoseri, ira goseri Yohani gakatakuliti kuusu muntu ayu ndo nakaka.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na wantu wavuwa pahala palii wamjimira.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Muntu yumu yawamshema Lazaru, kalikaliti Betaniya, kaweriti mlweri. Betaniya lushi lwawalikaliti Mariya na Marita muhasha gwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariya ndo uliya yakamswagiti uturi Mtuwa na kumpukuta kwa viri zyakuwi. Ayu ndo Lazaru kaka gwakuwi yakaweriti mlweri. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Wahasha watuma ujumbi kwa Yesu, “Mtuwa, ganja gwaku yagumfira, mlweri!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu pakapikaniriti aga, katakula, “Ulweri awu hapeni hujegi kuhowa kwa Lazaru, ira ndo kwajili ya kumkwisa Mlungu na kwa mana ayi Mwana gwa Mlungu kakwiswi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu kamfiriti Marita na muhasha gwakuwi pamuhera na Lazaru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Pakapatiti shisoweru handa Lazaru mlweri, kulikala pahala panu kwa mashaka mawili nentu. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Shakapanu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Tuwuyi kayi Yudeya!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wafundwa wamgambira, “Mfunda! Shaka shifupi hera shipita Wayawudi wafira kukuguma mabuwi, na gwenga gufira kugenda kayi aku?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu kankula, “Lishaka lyana saa lilongu na mbili ndiri, ndo hangu? Pakagendagenda paliwala hapeni kawezi kulikwala, kawona kulangala kwa pasipanu. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Kumbiti muntu pakagendagenda pashiru katalikwala, Toziya kulangala kwahera.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu katakuliti hangu na pakamaliriti, kawagambira, “Ganja gwetu Lazaru kagonja, kumbiti neni nankugenda na kumyumusiya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamgambira, “Mtuwa, handa yomberi kagonja su hakaponiziwi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Kumbiti Yesu kaweriti kankutakula kuusu kuhowa kwakuwi, womberi waliholiti kuwera kankutakula kuusu kugonja mbota. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu kawagambira pota kufifa, “Lazaru kahowa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />kumbiti nemelera kwa ajili ya mwenga handa mweri ndiri aku, su mpati kujimira. Haya tugendeni kwakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi yawamshema mawira kawagambira wantumini wamonga, “Tugendeni woseri pamuhera na mfunda tukahowi!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu uzyukusiya na ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu pakafikiti aku, kamwoniti Lazaru wamtula kala mlipumba kwa mashaka msheshi. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Shijiji sha Betaniya shiweriti pakwegera na Yerusalemu utali wa kilumita ntatu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />na Wayawudi wavuwa wiziti kumlola Marita na Mariya kuwapanani ushiwa kwa kuhowa kaka gwawu.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Shaka Marita pakapikaniriti handa Yesu kaweriti kamkwiza, kagenda kumwanka, kumbiti Mariya kasigaliti ukaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marita kamgambira Yesu, “Mtuwa handa gwangaweriti panu, kaka gwangu mekahowiti ndiri! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Kumbiti nuvimana handa ata vinu shoseri shagufira kumluwa Mlungu, hakakupi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu kamgambira, “Kaka gwaku hakawuyi mkomu kayi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marita kamwankula, “Nuvimana handa hawazyuki shaka sha uzyukisiwu, mulishaka lya kupelera.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu kamgambira, “Neni ndo uzyukisiya na ukomu. Yakanjimira neni ata tembera hakahowi, hakalikali. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na kila yakalikala na kunjimira, hapeni kahowi. Hashi, gujimira aga?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marita kamwankula, “Yina, Mtuwa! Neni njimira handa gwenga ndo Kristu, Mwana gwa Mlungu, uliya yakiza pasipanu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Marita pakatakuliti aga, kagenditi na kumshema Mariya mlongu gwakuwi, kamgambira pagweka, “mfunda kapanu na kafira kukuwona.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Nayomberi pakapikaniriti aga, kamukamu kagoloka, kamgendera Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu kaweriti keniyingiri mushijiji, kumbiti kaweriti palaa palii Marita pakamwankiti. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Su, Wayawudi yawaweriti ukaya pamuhera na Mariya pawamnyamaziya muushiwa, pawamwoniti kagoloka na kulawa kunja vumu, wamwiziriti. Wavimaniti kaweriti kankugenda mulipumba kudaya.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariya pakasokiti pahala palii Yesu pakaweriti na kumwona, kasuntamala, kamgambira, “Mtuwa, handa gwangaweriti panu, kaka gwangu kangahowiti ndiri!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu pakamwoniti kankulira na Wayawudi walii wawiziti pamuhera nayomberi wankulira viraa, kamemiti na maholu na kuhinginika mumoyu. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Shakapanu kawakosiya, “Lipumba lya koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Wamgambira, “Mtuwa, gwizi na gulori.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu kalira. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Su, Wayawudi watakula, “Mlori ntambu yakamfiriti!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Kumbiti wamonga wawu watakula, “Hashi, ayu yakamtenditi katumuli masu lwisi uliya, kaweza ndiri kumtenda Lazaru nakahowi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankumzyukusiya Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Su, Yesu kahinginika kayi mmoyu, kiziti mlipumba. Lipumba lyeni liweriti mpanga na liweriti ludiwirwa kwa libuwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu kalagaliriti, “Mliwusiyi libuwi ali!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Marita mlongu gwakuwi ayu yakahowiti kamgambira, “Mtuwa kanja kala kununka, kalikala mulipumba mashaka msheshi!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu kamgambira, “Hashi, nukugambira ndiri handa pagujimira haguwoni ukwisa wa Mlungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Su waliwusiya libuwi lilii, Yesu kalola kumpindi, katakula, “Mayagashii Tati toziya gwenga gumpikanira. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nuvimana handa gumpikanira neni. Kumbiti ntakula aga toziya ya wantu awa wapala panu su wapati kujimira handa gwenga ndo yaguntumiti.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Pakamaliriti kutakula aga, kashema kwa liziwu likulu, “Lazaru! Gulawi kunja!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Uliya yakaweriti kahowa kalawiti kunja, aku wamyopa sanda mmagulu na mmawoku na sheni shakuwi shigubikirwa. Yesu kawagambira, “Mumyopoli, mkamleki kagendi zyakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpangu gwa kumlaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Su, Wayawudi wavuwa waweriti wamtyangira Mariya pawawoniti Yesu shintu gaa shakatenditi, na kumjimira. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Kumbiti wamonga wawu wagenditi kwa Mafalisayu na wawagambira shitwatira ashi shakatenditi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Mafalisayu na watambika wakulu waliwoniti Mwashizungu na watakula, “Tutendi shishi? Muntu ayu kankutenda mauzauza nentu. <figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Mtambika gwa Shiyawudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Patumleka hera wantu woseri hawamjimiri, womberi Warumi hawizi kuwalibisiya Numba nkulu ya Mlungu gwetu na isi yetu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Panu yumu gwawu, yawamchema Kayafa, ndo kiwiti mtambika mkulu wa shinja ashi, kawagambira, “Mwenga muvimana ndiri shintu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Hashi, mwona ndiri handa ndo mbaka kwamwenga muntu yumu kahowi kwa ajili ya wantu, kuliku isi yoseri ipalanganyika?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Yomberi katakula ndiri hangu ntambu yakafiriti mweni, ira kaweriti mtambika mkulu shinja ashi su katungiti handa Yesu hakahowi toziya ya wantu wa Isi ya Shiyawudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />na toziya ndiri gweka yawu hera, kumbiti kapati kuwajega pamuhera munshimba yimu yaipalanganyikiti kwa wantu wa Mlungu.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Su, kwanjira lishaka ali watuwa wa Shiyawudi watenda mipangu gwa kumlaga Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Su, Yesu hapeni kagendigendi kayi paweru muisi ya Wayawudi, kumbiti kawukiti panu kagenditi pahala pagwekera na kushiwala, mlushi lwa walushema Efrayimu. Kalikaliti aku pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Shaka sha msambu sha Wayawudi sha Pasaka shiweriti pakwegera na wantu wavuwa walawa muisi wagenditi Yerusalemu su walipungi pa msambu agu. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Su, waweriti wankumsakula Yesu. Na womberi pawaliwoniti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, walikosiyana, “Mulihola hashi? Nakaka hakizi ndiri ku msambu agu, awu ndiri?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Watambika wakulu na Mafalisayu walagalira kuwera, handa muntu yoseri pakavimaniti pahala pakaweriti Yesu, kalazimika kutakula su wapati kumbata.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumswaga lipaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayu 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mariku 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Pamberi pa mashaka sita ga msambu gwa Pasaka, Yesu kafikiti Betaniya pakaya pa Lazaru, muntu yakamzyusiyiti kulawa kwawahowiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Aku wamtuliriti shiboga sha pamihi na Marita kaweriti kamtendera. Lazaru kaweriti yumu gwa walii wawaweriti wankuliya pamuhera na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariya katoliti supa ya uturi yawayishema naridu iherepa ya mpiya zivuwa, kamswaga Yesu mumagulu na kugapukuta kwa viri zyakuwi numba yoseri inunkira uturi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yumu gwa wafundwa wa Yesu, Yuda Isikariyoti yakafiriti kumgalambuka Yesu, katakula, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Uturi awu waweza kuwuza kwa mpiya zya shibenamgongu sha myezi tisa na mpiya azi wawayupi wahushu?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Katakuliti hangu, kwakuwawonera ndiri wahushu lusungu, toziya kaweriti mwivi na yomberi ndo yakakoliti muhaku gwa mpiya na kavitoliti vyawatuliti amu.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu katakula, “Mumleki mdala ayu! Kavituriti vyoseri vyakaweriti navi kwa lishaka lya kusilwa kwa neni. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Wahushu mwanawu mashaka goseri, kumbiti hamuweri ndiri na neni mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasakuliti ntambu ya kumlaga Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayawudi wavuwa wapikiniriti handa Yesu Kabetaniya. Su womberi wagenditi aku, wapati kumwona Yesu, kayi wafiriti kumwona Lazaru ulii yakamzyusiyiti na Yesu kulawa kwa wahowiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Watambika wakulu wasakuliti ntambu ya kumlaga Lazaru, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />toziya Wayawudi wavuwa wawalemiti wayawu na wamjimira Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Yerusalemu kwa kunemelera Mat. 21:1-11, Marko 11:1-11, Luka 19:28-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Shirawu yakuwi, lipinga likulu lya wantu wiziti kumsambu wapikiniriti Yesu kaweriti mnjira kwiza Yerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Watola maputira ga mitendi, walawa kugenda kumwanka, wabota pawatakula, “Gwenga mlopoziya gwetu! Katekelerwi ayu yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa. Katekelerwi Mfalumi gwa Israeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu kakwena mwana punda, kalivaga pampindi pakuwi gambira ntambu yagatakuliti Malembu,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Kotu kutira gwe lushi lwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Mfalumi gwaku kamkwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Kalivaga pampindi pa mwana punda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Shaka ashi wafundwa wakuwi wavimaniti ndiri shitwatira ashi shoseri, kumbiti Yesu pawamkwiswiti kala, womberi wagaholiti Malembu Mananagala gatakuliti kuusu yomberi na wagatenditi aga kwa yomberi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lipinga lya wantu walii wawaweriti pamuhera nayomberi shaka pakamshemiti Lazaru kulawa mlipumba, kamzyusiya kulawa kwawahowiti, watakuliti yagalawiriti. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Toziya ya aga, lipinga likulu lya wantu awa wamgenderiti Yesu, mana woseri wapikiniriti handa Yesu katenditi liuzauza ali. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Mafalisayu waligambiziyana, “Mwona? Hapeni tuwezi kutenda shoseri! Mlori, wantu wa pasipanu woseri wankumfata.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagiriki wamu Wafira kumlola Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kuweriti na Wagiriki wamu mu wantu yawaweriti wiza Yerusalemu kumkwisa Mlungu mushaka sha msambu. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Womberi wamgenderiti Filipu, yakalawiriti Betisayida mu Galilaya na watakula, “Mtuwa, tufira kumwona Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipu kagenda na kamgambira Andereya na wawili wagenda na kumgambira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu kawawankula, Saa isoka kala kwa Mwana gwa Muntu kukwiswa! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nukugambirani nakaka, mbunji ya nganu isigala mbunji hera payiyalwa ndiri mulitapaka na kuwola. Handa payiwola, su ilera mbeyu zivuwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Woseri yawafira ukomu wawu hawawuhoviyi, yakagahoviya makaliru gakuwi pasipanu, hakagaponiziyi kwa makaliru ga mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Yakafira kuntendera ndo mpaka kanfati, pawera neni na ntumintumi gwangu hakaweri, kayi muntu pakantendera Tati hakampanani ligoya.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula kuusu kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Vinu rohu yaneni intama, ntakuli shishi? Ntakuli, ‘Tati, gunopoziyi shaka ashi pashisoka?’ Kumbiti ayi ndo toziya ya kwiza. Su shimpiti shaka ashi sha ntabiku. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tati, Kakwiswi litawu lyakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Panu liziwu litakula kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. “Nulikwisa na hanulikwisi kayi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Lipinga lya wantu lyaligolokiti palii lipikaniriti liziwu ali na wamu wawu watakuliti, “Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kankuyowera nayomberi!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Kumbiti Yesu kawagambira, “Liziwu ali lirandula ndiri kwajili yaneni, ira kwajili ya mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Vinu ndo shaka sha pasipanu kutozwa, vinu mtuwa gwa pasipanu hawamwusiyi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Neni panu panyasulwa kumpindi kwa Mlungu hanumkwezeniziyi kila muntu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Kakutakula hangu kalanguziya ntambu gaa hakahowi.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Lipinga ali limwankula. Twenga watugambira Malagaliru getu handa Kristu hakalikali mashaka goseri. Su, guweza hashi kutakula eti mwana gwa Muntu imbidi kanyasulwi? Mwana gwa Muntu ndo gaa?<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu kawagambira, “Gulangala haguweri pakati penu katepu hera. Mgendi toziya mnawu gulangala agu, ntiti hapeni iwapati, toziya yakagendagenda muntiti kavimana ndiri kwakagenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Shaka shamuwera na gulangala agu, mugujimiri, su mpati kuwera wantu wa gulangala.” Pakalongiti kala visoweru avi, Yesu kagenditi zakuwi na kulififa kutali na womberi.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wahera Moyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Tembera Yesu katenditi mauzauza goseri aga palongolu pawu, womberi wamjimira ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Su visoweru vyakatakuliti Isaya mbuyi gwa Mlungu vitimiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mtuwa, gaa yakajimiriti ujumbi watutakuliti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na uwezu wa Mtuwa ulilanguziya kwa gaa?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Na hangu womberi waweza ndiri kujimira, toziya Isaya katakula viraa,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Mlungu kagatula lwisi masu gawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Na kagazezetiya mahala gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Wawoni ndiri kwa masu gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Wavimani ndiri kwa mahala gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Na wanizira ndiri neni, Mlungu katakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Su mpati kuwaponiziya.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya katakuriti visoweru avi toziya kawoniti ukwisa wa Yesu, pakatakula visoweru vyakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ata hangu, kuvuwa kwa watuwa wa wakulu wa Shiyawudi wamjimiriti Yesu. Kumbiti toziya ya mafalisayu, wamjimiriti ndiri paweru kwa kutira handa wawatuli gweka mnumba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Wafiriti kuzyumwa na wantu kuliku kuzyumwa na Mlungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutozwa kwa Yesu pasipanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Shakapanu Yesu katakula kwa liziwu likulu, “Muntu yakanjimira, kanjimira ndiri neni hera, ira kamjimira viraa uliya yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yakamona neni kankumwona viraa ulii yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Neni na Gulangala, niza pasipanu su woseri wawanjimira waweri ndiri muntiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yakapikanira shisoweru shangu uganu kagakola ndiri, neni hapeni numtozi, hanumtozi ndiri. Niza ndiri kuwatoza wantu wa pasipanu ira kuwalopoziya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Woseri yawanema neni na kuujimira ndiri ujumbi waneni, kwana yumu yakiza kuwatoza. Visoweru vyantakula haviweri vyakuwatoza mulishaka lya kupelera. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ayi ndo nakaka, toziya neni ntakula ndiri kwa uwezu wangu namweni, kumbiti Tati yakantumiti ndomweni yakantumiti ntakuli shishi na nyoweri shishi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Naneni nuvimana weri lilagaliru lyakuwi lijega ukomu wa mashaka goseri. Su, neni ntakula hera galii Tati yakanagaliriti nugatakuli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwagulula magulu Wantumini wakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Iweriti lishaka lya pamberi pa msambu gwa Pasaka. Yesu kavimaniti handa saa yakuwi isoka ya kuwuka pasipanu na kugenda kwa Tati. Shaka shoseri yomberi kawafiriti nentu wantu wa pasipanu yawaweriti wakuwi, na kawafiriti mpaka lupeleru!<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu pamuhera na wantumini wakuwi waweriti walivaga kuliya shiboga sha pamihi. Shetani kingiriti kala mumoyu mwa Yuda, mwana gwa Simoni Isikariyoti, maholu ga kumgalambuka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu kavimaniti handa Tati kaweriti kamupa makakala, kavimaniti kuwera kalawa kwa Mlungu na kaweriti kankugenda kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Su, kawukiti pashitalawanda, kayikusa nguwu yakuwi, katola shitambala na kulitawa mushyunu mwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Shakapanu katula mashi mubakuli, kanja kuwagulula magulu wafundwa wakuwi kugapukuta kwa shitambala shilii shakashitawiti mushinu mwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Pakiziti kwa Simoni Peteru, nayomberi katakula, “Mtuwa, hashi gwenga gwiza kugagulula magulu ganeni?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu kamwankula, “Gwenga hapeni gwerewi vinu shantenda ashi, kumbiti hagwelewi shakapanu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Peteru kamgambira, “Gwenga hapeni gungululi magulu gangu nakamu!” Yesu kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">“Pangulula ndiri magulu gaku, hapeni guweri ntumintumi gwangu kayi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Peteru kamwankula, “Mtuwa, nagungululi magulu hera! Gugagululi mawoku gangu na mtuwi viraa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu kamgambira, “Yawakoga kala wawera waherepa na wafiruwa ndiri kunawa ira magulu gawu. Mwenga muherepa, kumbiti mwawoseri ndiri.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu kamumaniti kala ulii yakagenda kumgalambuka, ndo mana kalongiti, “Mwenga muherepa, kumbiti yumu kaherepa ndiri.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Pakamaliriti kuwagulula magulu gawu, kavulumula nguwu yakuwi, na kalivagiti pahala pakuwi pakwegera na meza, su yomberi kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwerewa shanuwatenderani mwenga?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />“Mwenga munshema mfunda na Mtuwa, mwenga mtakula weri toziya ndo neni. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Paiwera neni Mtuwa gwenu na mfunda gwenu, nuwanaviya magulu mwenga, mwenga viraa mfiruwa kulinawiviyana magulu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nukupanani kala mfanu, su mwenga mtendi viraa ntambu yanuwatenderani. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nuwagambirani nakaka, wantumintumi wakulu ndiri kuliku mtuwa gwawu na ntumintumi hapeni kaweri mkulu kuliku ulii yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Vinu muumana unakaka awu, hamuweri na sekuseku pamgatenda.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Aga gantakula gawawusu ndiri mwenga mawoseri. Neni nuwamana walii yanuwasyaguliti. Kumbiti mpaka gatimii Malembu Mananagala gaweri nakaka ntambu yagalembwa, ‘Muntu yakaliyiti pamuhera naneni shiboga shangu hakang'alambuki’. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Neni nuwagambireni vitwatira avi vinu pamberi kulawira. Su pagalawila mpati kujimira kuwera ‘Neni ndo Mweni’. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nuwagambireni nakaka, yakamshemera yoseri ulii yanumtumiti, kanshemera neni viraa na yakanshemera neni ndo kamshemera ulii yakantumiti.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga kugalambukwa kwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayu 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mariku 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu pakatakuliti kala aga, kahinginikiti nentu mumoyu, katakula pota kufifa, “Nakaka nuwagambireni, yumu gwenu hakamgalambuki!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Wafundwa walilola weni, su waweriti wavimana ndiri handa gaa hakamgalambuki. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yumu gwa wafundwa, mweni Yesu ndo yakamfiriti nentu, kaweriti kalivaga pakwegera na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Peteru kamlanguziya kwa mawoku, kamgambira “Gumkosiyi katakula kuusu gaa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Su ntumintumi ulii kasegelera nentu uwega wa Yesu, kamkosiya, “Mtuwa, ndo gaa?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu kamwankula, “Ulii yanumupa shipandi sha libumunda shantotiti musahani, ndo mweni.” Su, kashitola shipandi sha libumunda, kashitota musahani, kamupa Yuda, mwana gwa Simoni Isikariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda pakayankiti kala shipandi sha libumunda, Shetani kamwingiriti yomberi. Su, Yesu kamgambiriti Yuda, “Gutendi kanongola shilii shagufira kutenda!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Woseri yawalivagiti kuliya shiboga wavimaniti ndiri kwantambu gaa Yesu katakuriti aga kwa yomberi. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yuda kaweriti mkola mpiya pakati pawu, wavimaniti kuwera Yesu kamgambiriti hakahemeri vilii vyawafiruwa mumsambu, ama kamgambiriti kakalaviyi shoseri kwa wahushu.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Su Yuda pakayankiti kala shipandi shilii sha libumunda, palaa paliya kalawa kunja. Na iweriti Pashiru.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagaliru lya syayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda pakawukiti kala, Yesu kalonga, “Vinu ukwisa wa Mwana gwa Muntu ugubutulwa, vinu ukwisa wa Mlungu ugubutulwa kupitira yomberi. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Handa ukwisa wa Mlungu paugubutulwa kupitira yomberi, su Mlungu hakaulanguziyi ukwisa wa Mwana gwa Muntu mngati mwakuwi, kamukamu hakatendi hangu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Wana wangu, nankali na mwenga katepu hera. Hamunsakuli, kumbiti vinu nukugambirani galii ganuwagambiriti kala wakulu wa Wayawudi, ‘Pang'endaku, mwenga hapeni mgendi.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Vinu nukupanani lilagaliru lya syayi, mulifiri weni. Handa yanukufirani mwenga, viraa vilii mulifiri weni. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Handa pamulifira weni, wantu woseri hawavimani kuwera mwenga ndo wafundwa waneni”.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga handa Peteru hakamlemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Peteru kamkosiya Yesu, “Mtuwa gwankugenda koshi?” Yesu kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">“Hapeni guwezi kunfata vinu kwang'endaku, kumbiti shakapanu hamunfati.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Peteru kamkosiya, “Mtuwa, kwantambu gaa nsindi kukufata vinu? Nakali kuhowa kwajili ya gwenga!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu kamwankula, “Hashi, ndo wakala nakaka kuhowa kwajili ya neni? Nukugambira nakaka, pamberi njogolu keniwiki, hagunemi mala tatu kuwera gumana ndiri neni.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu njira ya kugenda kwa Tati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu kawagambira, “Namuligaziya mumyoyu mwenu. Mumjimiri Mlungu na munjimiri neni viraa. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ukaya mwa Tati gwangu kwana numba zivuwa, nuwagambiriti kala na vinu nankugenda kuwanyawirani pahali penu. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na pang'enda na kuwanyawilireni pahala penu, hambuyi na kuwatola, su mwenga hamuweri pamuhera naneni. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Muyimana njira ya kugenda aku kwang'enda.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi kamkosiya, “Mtuwa, tuvimana ndiri kwagugenda, su twankuyimana hashi njira ayi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu kamwankula, “Neni ndo njira na unakaka na ukomu. Kwahera yakaweza kugenda kwa Tati ira kwa kupitira kwaneni. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Kawagambira, vinu mumana neni, mumana na Tati gwangu viraa. Na kwanjira vinu mumana na mumwona kala.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipu kamgambira, “Mtuwa, tumlanguziyi Tati, natwenga hatwikuti.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu kamwankula, “Filipu, nulikala namwenga kwa shaka shoseri, nagwenga gumana ndiri? Yakamoniti kala neni kamwona Tati. Guweza hashi kutakula, Tumlanguziyi Tati? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Hashi, mjimira ndiri handa neni namngati mwa Tati, nayomberi Tati ka mngati mwaneni? Visoweru nyanuwagambirani ntakula ndiri kwa utuwa waneni, Tati yakawera mngati mwaneni kankutenda lihengu lyakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Munjimiri neni pantakula handa neni na mngati mwa Tati na Tati kamngati mwaneni. Handa hangu ndiri, mjimiri toziya ya vintu vyantenda. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Nakaka nuwagambirani, yakanjimira neni hakatendi vitwatira vyantenda neni, yina, hakatendi vintu vikulu nentu, toziya nankugenda kwa Tati. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na shoseri shamluwa mulitawu lyaneni hantendi, su Tati kakwisuwi mngati mwa mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Pamunduwa shoseri mulitawu lyangu, hanuwatendereni.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagilu lya Rohu Mnanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Pamunfira neni, hamulijimili lilagaliru lyaneni. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Naneni hanumluwi Tati nayomberi hakawapanani mtanga yumonga, hakalikali namwenga kwa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Yomberi ndo Rohu yakalanguziya unakaka kuusu Mlungu. Wantu wa pasipanu waweza ndiri kumuwanka toziya waweza ndiri kumwona wala kummana. Kumbiti mwenga mumana toziya kalikala namwenga na ka mngati mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Pang'enda hanuwaleki ndiri mwawashiwa, hanizi kayi kwamwenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Katepu hera wantu wa pasipanu hawamoni kayi ndiri, kumbiti mwenga hamumoni. Toziya nana ukomu, viraa mwenga hamuweri na ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Lishaka lilii palisokiti hamuvimani handa neni na mngati mwa Tati na mwenga mngati mwaneni, naneni mngati mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Yakagayanka malagaliru ganeni na kugajimira, ndoweni walii yawanfira neni. Tati gwangu hakawafiri woseri yawanfira neni, naneni vulaa hanuwafiri womberi na hanulilanguziyi kwawomberi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, Yuda Isikariyoti ndiri, kamgambira, “Mtuwa, hashi iwezekana gwenga kulilanguziya kwatwenga na gulilanguziya ndiri kwa wantu wa pasipanu?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu kamwankula, “Muntu pakanfira neni hakagajimili mafundu gangu na Tati gwangu hakamfiri, neni pamuhera na Tati gwangu hatwizi kulikala nayomberi. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yakanfira ndiri hapeni kagajimili mafundu gangu. Na mafundu gampikaniriti gangu ndiri, galawa kwa Tati yakantumiti.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Nuwagambiriti vitwatira avi pamweriti nakali na mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Kumbiti mtanga, Rohu Mnanagala, ndomweni Tati hakamtumi mulitawu lyaneni, hakawafundeni kila shintu na kuwakumbusiyani goseri ganuwagambirani.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nuwalekera ponga, nuwapanani ponga yangu. Nuwapanani ndiri mwenga gambira wantu wa pasipanu ntambu yawatenda. Namuwera na lyoga ama namuhinginyika. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mpikaniriti kala panuwagambira, Nankugenda zyangu, shakapanu hambuyi kayi kwamwenga. Handa munganfiriti, munganemeli toziya nankugenda kwa Tati, yomberi ndo mkulu nentu kuliku neni. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nuwagambireni aga vinu pamberi ganalawira, su pagalawila mpati kujimira. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Ntakula ndiri namwenga kayi vitwatira avi vivuwa, mana mtuwa gwa pasipanu kankwiza. Hapeni kawezi shintu kwaneni, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />kumbiti wantu wa pasipanu mpaka wavimani handa numufira Tati, ndo mana ntenda kila shintu gambira Tati ntambu yakanamuwiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Mgoloki, tuwuki panu!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mzabibu gwa nakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Neni ndo mzabibu gwa nakaka, Tati gwangu ndo mlimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Yomberi kawusiyaga kila lutambi lwalulera ndiri mabwajubwaju mnumba mwangu na kila lutambi lwalulera nulugulula lupati kulera nentu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mwenga muwera kala muherepa toziya ya mafundu ganuwafunditi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mwikali mngati mwangu, naneni nulikali mngati mwenu. Lutambi hapeni luleri mabwajubwaju gweka yakuwi, haluleri paluwera mumtera gwa zabibu. Ntambu iraayi hapeni mleri mabwajubwaju mpaka muweri mngati mwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Neni namzyabibu, mwenga ndo mitambi. Woseri yawawera mngati mwangu, naneni mngati mwawu, hawaleli mabwajubwaju gavuwa, pamuhera ndiri naneni hapeni mtendi shintu shoseri. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Muntu yoseri pakalikala ndiri mngati mwangu kaswa kunja gambira lutambi lawalwasa kunja mpaka linyali, mitambi yeni ijojinirwa na kwasirwa pamotu, yeni ndo ilunguziwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Pamulikala mngati mwaneni na visoweru vyaneni paviwera mngati mwenu, hamluwi shoseri shamfira na hampati. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ukwisa wa Tati gwangu hawuwoneki pamulera mabwajubwaju na kwa njira ayi hamuweri wafundwa waneni. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nukufireni mwenga gambira Tati ntambu yakanfira neni, mulikali muwundama wa neni. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Handa pamjimila malagaliru gangu, hamulikali mu muwundama waneni, gambira neni ntambu yanjimiriti malagaliru ga Tati gwangu na nulikali muwufiru wakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Nukugambirani vitwatira avi su nemeleru yangu iweri mngati mwenu na nemeleru ya mwenga ikamiliki. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Lilagaliru lyangu ndo ali, mulifiri weni, ntambu yanuwafira mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Mafiliru makulu nentu kwa muntu kuulanguziya kwa waganja wakuwi ndo kuulaviya ukomu wakuwi kwa womberi. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mwenga ndo waganja waneni handa pamtenda shilii shanuwalagaliriti. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Mwenga hapeni nuwashemi kayi wamanda, toziya wamanda hapeni wavimani vyawatenda watuwa wawu. Kumbiti nuwashema mwenga waganja, toziya nuwagambiriti vitwatira vyoseri vyanpikaniriti kwa Tati gwangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mwenga munsyagula ndiri neni, kumbiti neni ndo yanuwasyaguliti mwenga na kuwatuma mgendi mwakaleri mabwajubwaju nentu, mabwajubwaju yagalikala. Su Tati hakakupanani shoseri shamluwa mu litawu lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Su, lilagaliru lyangu kwa mwenga ndo ali, mulifiri weni kwa weni.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalaliru ya wantu wa pasipanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Handa wantu wa pasipanu pawakukalalirani, mliholi kuwera wankalalira neni kwanja pamberi pa kuwakalalira mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Handa memuweriti wamu wa wantu wa pasipanu, wantu wa pasipanu wangawafiriti gambira wantu wawu weni. Kumbiti nuwasyagula mwenga kulawa pasipanu, toziya wantu wa pasipanu wawakalalira mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Muliholi shilii shanuwagambiriti, ‘Wamanda hapeni waweri wakulu kuliku watuwa wawu.’ Handa wantu pawamberiti neni, hawawaberi mwenga viraa, handa wagajimiriti mafundu ganeni, hawagajimili mafundu genu viraa. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Kumbiti womberi hawatendi vyoseri avi kwa mwenga toziya mwenga waneni, kwani wamumana ndiri ulii yakantumiti. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Handa nganiziti ndiri na kutakula na womberi wangaweriti ndiri na vidoda, kumbiti vinu hapeni wawezi kutakula wahera vidoda. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yakankalalira neni, kamkalalira Tati gwangu viraa. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Handa nangantenda ndiri kwawomberi vitwatira vyeni kwahera muntu yumonga yakavitenditi kala mwangaweriti ndiri na vidoda, kumbiti vinu waviwoniti vyantenditi wankalalira neni pamuhera na Tati gwangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ndo toziya galii gagalembitwi mu Malagaliru gawu ganakaka, ‘Wankalalira hera!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Mtanga yakiza ndo Rohu, hakagubutuli unakaka kuusu Mlungu, ndo mweni kiza kulawa kwa Tati. Hanumtumi kwa mwenga kulawa kwa Tati na hakankapitaulili neni. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Mwenga viraa, hampitaulili kuusu neni, toziya muweriti pamuhera na neni kwanjira kwanja.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nuwagambiriti aga, su namleka moyu gwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Wantu hawawawingi mwenga kulawa Mnumba zya Mlungu zyenu na shaka hashizi yoseri pakakulageni hakavimani kamtendera Mlungu lihengu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Wantu hawawatenderani vitwatira avi toziya womberi wamumana ndiri Tati ama neni. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Kumbiti nukugambirani aga, su shaka pashizaku kwa womberi kutenda vitwatira avi, hamuliholi kuwera nuwagambiriti kala.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Lihengu lya Rohu Mnanagala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Nuwagambiriti ndiri vitwatira avi kwanjira kwanja, toziya nweriti pamuhera namwenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Su vinu nankugenda kwa ulii yakantumiti, kwahera ata yumu gwenu yakankosiya neni pang'endaku. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Vinu nuwagambirani vitwatira avi, myoyu yenu ihinginika. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kumbiti, nankuwagambirani nakaka, Iherepa kwa mwenga neni ng'endi zangu, toziya pang'enda ndiri, Mtanga hapeni kizi kwa mwenga. Kumbiti pang'enda zyangu, hanumtumi yomberi kizi kwa mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nayomberi pakizaku, hakawalunguziyi unakaka wantu wa pasipanu kuwera watenda upyota kuusu vidoda na vintu vyavimfiriziya Mlungu na utoza wa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Watenditi upyota kuusu vidoda toziya wanjimira ndiri neni, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />na kuusu vyavimfiriziya Mlungu, toziya nankugenda kwa Tati, hapeni mumoni kayi, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />nawomberi wapayira kuusu kutoza, toziya mkolamlima gwa pasipanu katozwa kala.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nanaga gavuwa gakuwagambireni, kumbiti vinu hapeni muwezi kugahepelera. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Kumbiti pakizaku Rohu ayu, hakagubutuli unakaka kuusu Mlungu, hakawalongoziyi mu unakaka woseri. Hakatakuli ndiri kwa uwezu wakuwi mweni, kumbiti hakatakuli shilii shakapikinira na hakawagambiri vintu vyaviyiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yomberi hakanupi neni ukwisa, toziya hakawagambiri shilii shantakula na shilii shanumgambira kawagambiri. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vyoseri vyakawera navi Tati vyaneni, ndo mana nuwagambirani kuwera Rohu Mnanagala hakawapanani vilii vyakapatiti kulawa kwaneni.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hinginika na Nemeru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Shakali shaka shididi hapeni mumoni kayi na shaka shididi shakapanu hamumoni.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamu walikosiyana, “Kamaanisha shishi? Katugambira kwa shaka shididini hapeni tumwoni, kayi shaka shididini hatumwoni, viraa katakuriti kayi, ‘Toziya nankugenda kwa Tati.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Su, waweriti wankulikosiyana, kamaanisha shishi pakatakula, ‘shakali shaka shididini?’ Tuvimana ndiri shakayowera!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu kavimaniti handa wafiriti kumkosiya, su kawagambira, “Hashi mlikosiyana ntambu yanongiti, ‘Shakali shaka shididini hapeni mumoni kayi na shaka shididi shakapanu hamumoni?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nankuwagambirani nakaka, hamulili na kudaya, kumbiti wantu wa pasipanu hawanemeleri, hamuhinginiki, kumbiti kuhinginika kwamwenga hakugalambuki kuwera nemeleru. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Shaka mdala pakalera, kawera na hinginika toziya shaka sha kuwera mundabiri shankwiza, kumbiti mwana pakiwuka, yomberi kalyaluwa, toziya kawera na nemeleru kwiwuka kwa mwana pasipanu. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Mwenga viraa mwanguhinginika vinu vinu, kumbiti hanuwawuyili kayi, mwenga hamuweri na nemeli mumyoyu mwenu na nemeli ayi kwahera muntu yakaweza kuyiwusiya kwamwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Lishaka ali lyankwiza, hapeni munuwi shoseri. Nukugambirani nakaka, Tati hakawapanani shoseri shamumluwa kupitira litawu lyaneni. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mpaka vinu munuwiti ndiri shoseri kwa litawu lyangu. Munduwi shoseri, namwenga hampati su nemeli yamwenga ipera.”<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nupakanga pasipanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nuwagambirani vitwatira avi kwa mafumbu. Kumbiti shaka hashizi hapeni ntumiyi mafumbu kuwagambira, su hantakuli pota kufifa kuusu Tati. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Lishaka ali palizaku, mwenga hamuluwi kwa litawu lyaneni, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />toziya Tati mweni kawafira mwenga. Yomberi kawafira mwenga toziya munfira neni na kujimira kuwera niziti kulawa kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Niziti kulawa kwa Tati na niziti pasipanu, vinu nankuwuka pasipanu, nankugenda kwa Tati.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Su, wafundwa wakuwi wamgambira, “Vinu gwankutakula pota kufifa, gutakula ndiri kwa mafumbu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Vinu tuvimana kuwera gwenga guvimana kila shintu, gufira ndiri muntu yoseri kakukosiyi. Ayi itutenda tujimiri kuwera gwenga gulawa kwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu kawankula, “Hashi, vinu mjimira? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Shaka shankwiza, na shapalaa kala, pawawapalasiya mwoseri mwenga, kila yumu pakawuya ukaya kwakuwi, hamundeki gweka yangu. Kumbiti nagweka yangu ndiri, toziya Tati kapamuhera na neni. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nuwagambiriti aga, su hamuweri na ponga kwa kuwera pamuhera na neni. Wantu wa pasipanu hawawatendi ntabiki. Kumbiti muweri wagangamala! Neni nuwakanga kala wantu wa pasipanu!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaluwira wantumintumi wakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu pakamaliriti kutakula aga, kalola kumpindi, kalonga. “Tati, shaka shisoka! Gumkwisi mwana gwaku su Mwana kapati kukukwisa gwenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Gumpananiti uwezu kwa wantu woseri, su guwapanani ukomu wa mashaka goseri woseri awa wagumpananiti. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na ukomu wa mashaka goseri ndo awu, kukumana gwenga yaguwera gweka yaku Mlungu gwa nakaka na kumana Yesu Kristu, yagumtumiti. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Neni nuulanguziya ukwisa waku pasipanu, ntenda kala lihengu lyagumpananiti ntendi. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Tati! Gunkwisi pawulongolu paku vinu, ukwisa ulii yatuweriti nawu pamuhera pamberi pa kunyawa pasipanu.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nukutenda gumanikani kwa wantu walii wagumpanani kulawa pasipanu. Waweriti wantu wakuwi. Na gwenga gumpananiti waweri waneni. Womberi washipikanira shisoweru shakuwi, <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />na vinu wavimana handa kila shagumpananiti shilawa kwagwenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Nuwapanani ujumbi ulii wagumpananiti na womberi wawuwanka, wavimana nakaka ndawiti kwagwenga na wajimira handa gwenga guntumiti.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nuwaluwira awa. Nuwaluwira ndiri wantu woseri wa pasipanu kumbiti nuwaluwira wagumpananiti, mana ndo waku. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Vyoseri vyawera navi ndo vyaku na vyaku ndo vyaneni na ukwisa waneni uwonikana pakati pa wantu wagumpananiti. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Na vinu niza kwakuwi, namulamu ndiri kayi pasipanu, kumbiti womberi wamulamu pasipanu. Tati Mnanagala! Kwa likakala lya litawu lyaku lyagumpananiti, shondi shondi guwatuli weri su waweri yumu gambira twenga ntambu yatuwera yumu. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Pamuweriti nawomberi, neni nuwalolera weri kwa likakala lya litawu lyaku lyagumpananiti. Neni nuwalolera, kwahera ata yumu gwawu yakagamiriti, kumbiti ulii yumu yakagamiriti, su Malembu Mananagala gapati kutimirika. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Na, vinu niza kwagwenga na ntakula vitwatira avi pasipanu, su waweri na nemeleru ikamilika mumyoyu mwawu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nuwapananiti ujumbi waku na wantu wa pasipanu wawakalalira toziya womberi wa pasipanu ndiri, gambira neni gwa pasipanu ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nduwa ndiri guwawusiyi pasipanu, kumbiti nduwa guwaloleri na mkondola uliya. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Womberi wa pasipanu ndiri, handa viraa ntambu yanwera ndiri gwa pasipanu. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Guwapungi waweri wagwenga munakaka, shisoweru shaku ndo shanakaka. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ntakula viraa ntambu yaguntumiti pasipanu, naneni viraa nuwatuma womberi pasipanu, <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />na kwajili yawu, namweni neni nulitula kwa gwenga su nawomberi viraa wapungwi muunakaka.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Nuwaluwira awa ndiri hera, kumbiti nuwaluwira viraa woseri yawajimira toziya ya ujumbi awu. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nduwa su woseri waweri yumu. Tati! Nduwa waweri mngati mwa twenga gambira viraa gwenga ntambu yaguwera mngati mwaneni, naneni mngati mwaku. Nduwa waweri yumu su pasipanu papati kujimira handa gwenga guntumiti. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Neni nuwapanani ukwisa ulaa uliya wagumpananiti neni, su waweri shintu shimu gambira twenga ntambu yatuwera yumu, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />neni, namngati mwawu nagwenga mngati mwangu, nduwa wakamiliki na waweri yumu, su wantu wa pasipanu wapati kumana gwenga guntumiti na guwafiri womberi ntambu yagunfira neni.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tati! Nfira awa wagumpananiti waweri pamuhera naneni palaa panu, su wawoni ukwisa waneni wagumpananiti, toziya gunfiriti neni pamberi pa kunyawa pasipanu. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tati Muheri! Wantu wa pasipanu wakumana ndiri, kumbiti neni nukumana. Awa wavimana handa gwenga guntumiti. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nukutenda gumanikani, na haendereyi kutenda hangu, su ufiru yaguwera nawu kwaneni uweri mngati mwawu, naneni hanweri mngati mwawu.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumubata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu pakamaliliti kuluwa, kagenditi kumwambu kulushemba Kedironi, pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi. Pahala panu paweriti na shiwunga sha mitera, Yesu kingira amu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, kamgalambukiti Yesu, pakamaniti pahala panu kwani mala zivuwa Yesu kaliwoniti na wafundwa wakuwi pahala palii. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yuda katoriti shipinga sha wanjagila kulawa kwa watambika wakulu wa Numba ya Mlungu na Mafalisayu, su kiza nawu mushiwunga womberi waweriti na limbamba lya motu na vimagi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, kavimana goseri gagafira kumpata, kalawira, kawakosiya, “Mwankumsakula gaa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nawomberi wankula, “Yesu gwa Nazareti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu kawagambira, “Neni ndo mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda yakaweriti kamgalambukiti kagoloka pamuhera nawomberi. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu pakawagambiriti, “Neni ndo mweni,” Wawuya kumbeli, waguwa pasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu kawakosiya kayi, “Mwankumsakula gaa?” Wamwankula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">“Yesu gwa Nazareti!”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu kawagambira, “Nuwagambireni kala neni ndo mweni. Su, payiwera mwankunsakula neni, muwaleki awa wagendi zyawu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Katakula aga su gapati kutimiya galii ganakaka gagatakulitwi, “Walii yagunupiti Tati, numwasa ndiri ata yumu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Peteru kaweriti na ligumba, su, kuwulaviya kalidumura likutu lya kumliwu lya ntumintumi gwa Mtambika Mkulu. Ntumintumi ayu wamshema Malikusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Su, Yesu kamgambira Peteru, “Guwuzii ligumba waku mumuhaku. Hashi, gulihola handa nandi ndiri lwindi sha ndabiri shakanupiti Tati gwangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kapalongolu pa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Shikundi sha wanjagila wa Rumi na Mnjagira mkulu na walolera wa Wayawudi wamkamuliti Yesu, wamtawa, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na kumjega kwanja kwa Anasi. Anasi kaweriti mganafu gwa Kayafa ndo mweni kaweriti Mtambika mkulu gwa shinja shilii. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa ayu ndo ulii yakaweriti kawagambiriti Wayawudi, membaka muntu yumu kahowi kwajili ya wantu wavuwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Peteru pamuhera na mfundwa gwingi wamfatiti Yesu. Toziya mfundwa yumonga ayu kaweriti kamanikana nentu kwa Mtambika Mkulu, hangu kagenda pamuhera na Yesu pakati pamdamu pa Mtambika Mkulu <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Peteru pakaweriti kagoloka paligomi . Su, mfundwa gwingi yakamanikaniti na Mtambika mkulu kalawiti kunja, katakula na mdala yakaweriti paligomi na kumjega Peteru mungati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mnjagira mhinja ayu gwapaligomi kamkosiya Peteru, “Hashi nagwenga viraa yumu gwa wafundwa wa muntu ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Peteru kamgambira, “Ndala, neni ndiri!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Wantumintumi na wawanjagila waweriti wakoziya motu toziya kuweriti na mpepu, waweriti wanguyotera motu. Peteru kaweriti kagoloka pamuhera nawomberi kakwotera motu.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtambika Mkulu kankumkosiya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayu 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mariku 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mtambika Mkulu kamkosiya Yesu kuusu wafundwa wakuwi na mafundu gakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu kamwankula, “Ntakula na kila muntu mashaka goseri pawonikaniti. Kila mala nfunda munumba za Mlungu na Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, pahala pawalyonaga Wayawudi woseri na wala ntakula ndiri shoseri kwa kufifa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Hashi gunkosiya neni? Guwakosiyi wantu yawampikinira neni. Womberi wavimana vyanuwagambiriti, wavimana shintu shantakuliti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Pakamaliliti kutakula aga yumu gwa wanjagila kamkomiti Yesu likofi pakalonga, “Gumwankula ntambu ayi Mtambika Mkulu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu kankula, “Handa ntakula weri ndiri, gumugambiri kila muntu ka panu iweriti hashi, kumbiti handa ntakula weri, iwera hashi gunkoma?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Su, Anasi kamjega Yesu kwa Mtambika Mkulu Kayafa pawamtawa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumlema kayi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayu 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mariku 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Peteru kaweriti panu kanguyotera motu. Su, wamkosiya, “Hashi, nagwenga viraa yumu gwa wafundwa wakuwi muntu ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Yomberi kaberiti na kutakula, “Neni ndiri”.<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumu gwa wantumintumi wa Mtambika Mkulu, nayomberi kaweriti mlongu gwa ulii yakadumulitwi likutu na Peteru katakula nukuwoniti pamuhera na Yesu mushiwunga sha mitera.<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Peteru kamlema kayi, palaa paliya njogolu kawika.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulongolu kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayu 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mariku 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Mandawila putiputi Yesu wamtola kwa Kayafa, wamjega mpaka kwa Liwali, wakulu awa wa Shiyawudi wingira ndiri amu, wafiriti ndiri kuwera wahumba, toziya wafiriti wawezi kuliya shiboga sha Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Su Pilatu kawagendiriti kulaa kunja, kawakosiya, “Muntu ayu katenda vintu gaa vidoda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Wamwankuliti, “Handa ayu kangaweriti muntu yakatenda gaherepa twangamjegiti ndiri kwagwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilatu kawagambira, “Mumutoli maweni muntu ayu, mumutozi kulawirana na malagaliru genu maweni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wayawudi wamwankula, “Twenga twahera uwezu wa kumtoza muntu yoseri kahowi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Vilawiriti avi su viweri nakaka visoweru vyakatakuliti Yesu kulanguziya kuhowa na ntambu hakahowi.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilatu kawuya kayi mu liboma na kamshema Yesu, kamkosiya, “Eti, gwenga gwa mfalumi gwa Wayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu kamwankula, “Hashi, gunkosiya hangu gumweni gwenga ama kwana wamonga wakugambira visoweru vyaneni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatu kamwankula, “Hashi, gulihola Namyawudi neni? Wantu waku na watambika wakulu wakujega kwaneni. Gutenda shishi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu katakula, “Utuwa waneni wa pasipanu ndiri, handa Utuwa waneni megaweri wa pasipanu, wantumintumi wa neni mewankomi ndiri, naniza kubatwa na Wayawudi, kumbiti Ufalumi wa neni wa pasipanu ndiri!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilatu kamkosiya, “Gwenga gwa mtuwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu kankula, “Gwenga gutakula neni na mtuwa. Neni nyiwukiti na kwiza pasipanu kwa shintu shimu, gutakula nakaka. Kwa ntambu ayi niza na unakaka. Kila yakawera na unakaka awu hakampikiniri.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatu kamkosiya, “Unakaka ndo shintu gaa?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu wankumtoza kuhowa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayu 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mariku 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilatu kawagendiriti kayi Wayawudi kunja na kawagambira, “Neni mona ndiri shidoda shoseri kwakuwi shakumtozera. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Kumbiti, kwa mwenga kwana shitiba sha neni kumvugulira muntu yumu mushibetubetu shaka sha Pasaka, mfira numulekeziyani mfalumi gwa Wayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Wamwankula pawabota, “Ndala, ayu ndiri, tumfira Baraba!” Baraba yakaweriti mpokaji kwa wantu.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Su, Pilatu katakuriti Yesu wamtoli, wamsyatangi ntomondu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Wanjagira wapota lijenjeri lya misontu na wamtula mumutuwi, wamvarisiya na lihabiti lya shifalumi. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Wamwizira na kutakula, “Mwika, Mtuwa gwa Wayawudi!” Wamgendera na kumwakula makofi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilatu kalawa kayi kunja, kawagambira, “Mlori, numjega kunja kwamwenga, mpati kuvimana handa neni mona ndiri shidoda shoseri kwakuwi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Su, Yesu kalawa kunja pakavala lijenjeri lya misontu na lihabiti lya shifalumi. Pilatu kawagambira, “Mlori! Muntu mweni ndo ayu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Watambika Wakulu na wanjagila pawamwoniti wabota, “Gumpingiki! Gumpingiki!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilatu kawagambira, “Su mumutoli maweni mkampingiki, toziya neni mona ndiri vidoda vyoseri kwakuwi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayawudi wamwankula, “Twenga twanaga malagaliru na kulawirana na malagaliru aga, ndo mpaka kahowi, toziya kalitakuziya mweni ka Mwana gwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilatu pakapikaniriti visoweru avi katiriti nentu. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Kingira kayi mngati mwa ikulu, kamkosiya Yesu, “Gulawa koshi gwenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula ndiri shintu. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilatu kamgambira, “Gutakula ndiri naneni? Guliholi, guvimana ndiri handa nanawu uwezu wa kukuvugulira na uwezu wa kukupingika?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu kamwankula, “Meguweri na uwezu woseri kwa neni hera toziya yakakupanani ndo Mlungu. Su muntu yakanjegiti kwa gwenga kana vidoda vikulu nentu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pilatu pakapikiniriti aga, kaweriti kakusakula ntambu ya kumlekiziya Yesu, kumbiti lipinga lya Wayawudi liwuyiriti kushowangana, “Pagumlekeziya muntu ayu, gwenga gwa ganja ndiri gwakuwi Kayisari Mfalumi mkulu wa Warumi, kila muntu yakalitenda kuwera Mfalumi kamlema Kayisari Mfalumi mkulu wa Warumi!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Su, Pilatu pakapikaniriti visoweru avi kamjega Yesu kunja, kalivaga pashiti sha kutoza, pahala wapashema, “Sakafu ya libuwi.” Kwa Shiebraniya, “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Iweriti ipata saa sita paliwala, lishaka lya kutandira Pasaka. Pilatu kawagambira Wayawudi, “Mlori, mfalumi gwenu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Womberi washowangana, “Gumlagi! Gumlagi! Mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilatu kawakosiya, “Hashi, numupingiki mfalumi gwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Watambika wakulu wamwankula, “Twenga twahera Mfalumi ira Kayisari Mfalumi mkulu gwa Warumi!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Su, panu Pilatu kamlekiziya Yesu mumawoku mwawu su wampingiki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu wankumpingika mlupingika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Su, wamtola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Nayomberi kalawa kiwiti kalitola lupingika lwakuwi kugenda pahala pawashemapu “Shipalakasa sha Mtuwi.” Kwa Shiebraniya Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Wampingika aku na wantu wawili wamonga wawapingika, yumu uwega wakuwi wa kumliwu na mmonga uwega wakuwi wa kumshigi. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatu kalembiti malembu kagatula pampindi pa lupingika. Iweriti ilembwa hangu, “Yesu gwa Nazareti, Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Wayawudi wavuwa wagasomiti malembu aga, mana pahala panu pawampingikiti Yesu paweriti pakwegera na lushi. Kayi malembu aga gaweriti galembwa kwa Shiebraniya na Shilatini na Shigiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Watambika Wakulu wa Shiyawudi wamgambira Pilatu, “Nagulemba, ‘Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi,’ Kumbiti gulembi yomberi katakuliti, Neni ndo Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatu kankula, “Ganembiti, nemba!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Wanjagira pawamaliriti kumpinjika Yesu, wazitoliti nguwu zakuwi, wagawana vifungu msheshi, shifungu shimu kwa kila mjagira. Watoliti viraa na rihabiti lyakuwi, rihabiti ali liweriti rifumwa kwa shipandi shimu hera, pota na mshonu. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Wanjagira awa waligambiziyana, “Hapeni kuyikashula, ira wazigalambuziya simbi ziweri zya gaa?” Shitwatila ashi shitendikiti su gatimiyi Malembu Mananagala yagatakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Wagawaniti nguwu womberi kwa womberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">Na nguwu zaneni wazigalambuziya simbi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Su, ntambu yawatenditi wanjagila walii.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Pakwegera na lupingika lwa Yesu, paweriti wagoloka mawu gwakuwi na mlongu gwa mawu gwakuwi, Mariya Mdala gwa Kileopa na Mariya Magidalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu pakamwoniti mawu gwakuwi na pakwegera nayomberi kagoloka uliya mfundwa yakamfiriti, kamgambira mawu gwakuwi, “Mawu! Gulori, ayu ndo mwanagwaku.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Shakapanu kamgambira mfundwa ulii, gulori, “Ayu ndomweni mawu gwaku.” Na kwanjira shaka shilii mfundwa ayu kamtoliti katami ukaya kwakuwi.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuhowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu kavimaniti handa goseri gaweriti gatimia na su Malembu Mananagala gapati kutimiya, katakula, “Mona kuyumuluwa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Panu paweriti na libakuli limema siki. Su, watota sifongu pakati pa siki ayi, wayitula pampindi pa ufitu wa hisopu wamlandisiya. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu pakalanditi siki, katakula “Gapera!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Shakapanu kango'ng'onala mtuwi gwakuwi, kahowa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumsoma mgoha paluwavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Shakapanu Wakulu wa Wayawudi wamkosiya Pilatu wamegi magulu gawu wawapingikiti na kusulusiya nshimba kulawa mlupingika, wakosiyiti hangu toziya iweriti Ijumaa lishaka lya matandiru ga Pasaka na wafiriti ndiri nshimba kusigala mlupingika lishaka lya Kwoyera, paliyanja lishaka lya kwoyera toziya ya lishaka likulu. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Su, wanjagila wagenditi, wagamega magulu ga uliya gwa kwanja na uliya gwa pili ndomweni kaweriti kapingikwa pamuhera na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Kumbiti pawamwiziriti Yesu, wawoniti kuwera kahowiti kala na hangu wammega ndiri magulu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Kumbiti mjagira yumu kamtobuliti Mluwavu kwa mgoha na palaa paliya mwazi na mashi galawa. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Nayomberi yakawoniti shitwatira ashi kalaviya visoweru vyakuwi su mwenga mpati kujimira. Na aga yagapitawulitwi ndo nakaka, kayi yomberi kavimana handa kankutakula nakaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Shitwatila ashi shashitenditwi su Malembu Mananagala gatimiyi, “Kwahera ata shifupa shakuwi shimu hashimegwi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ilembwa kayi Mumalembu Mananagala gatakula, “Hawamloli uliya yawamtobuliti.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mauti ga Yesu wagatula Mulipumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Pa aga, Yosefu, mwenikaya gwa Arimatayu, kamluwa Pilatu kayitoli nshimba ya Yesu. Yosefu kaweriti mfundwa gwa Yesu, kumbiti kwa kubada, toziya kawatiriti wakulu wa Wayawudi. Su, Pilatu kajimira. Hangu Yosefu kagenditi, kayitola nshimba ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemu yomberi kaweriti kamgendera Yesu pashiru, wagenditi pamuhera na Yosefu kiza pakajega muhanganyiku gwa manimani na ubani wa kilu milongu mitatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Su, watola nshimba ya Yesu. Waitawa sanda pamuhera na uturi kulinganira na shitiba sha Wayawudi shakusira. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Pahala panu pawampingikiti Yesu paweriti na shiwunga na pakati pashiwunga ashi paweriti na lipumba lyampanga lyaliweriti lyasyayi, wamsira ndiri muntu yoseri mnumba mwakuwi. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Toziya ya lihengu lya Wayawudi lya matandiru ga Lishaka lya Kwoyera, toziya lipumba lya mpanga ali liweriti pakwegera, wagatula mauti ga Yesu mlaa.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kwahera mulipumba lya mpanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayu 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mariku 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Mandawira putiputi jumapili, kuweriti kwangali ntiti, Mariya Magidalena kagenditi kulipumba lya mpanga na kaliwona libuwi lilii liwusiwa paligomi gwa lipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Su kagenda mbiru mpaka kwa Simoni Peteru na ulii mfundwa yumonga ndomweni Yesu kamfiriti, kawagambira, “Wamwusiya Mtuwa Mulipumba lya mpanga na tuvimana ndiri pawamtuliti.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Peteru na mfundwa yumonga ulii wagenda kulipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Woseri wawili watugiti, Kumbiti mfundwa yumonga ulii katugiti mbiru kuliku Peteru na kalongolera kusoka kulipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Pakasunguliliti na kawoniti sanda, kumbiti kingira ndiri mlipumba. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Peteru kamfata na kingira mlipumba, amu kayiwona sanda, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na shitambala shawamtawiti Yesu Mutuwi. Shitambala ashi washitula ndiri pamuhera na sanda ayi, kumbiti shiweriti shibiringiziwa na shitulwa pahali pa gweka hera. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Mfundwa yumonga yakasokiti kulipumba lya mpanga, kingira viraa mulipumba lya mpanga, kawona na kajimira. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Waweriti wankali kugamana Malembu Mananagala yagatakuliti kuwera mpaka kazyuki. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Su, wafundwa awa wawuya ukaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamlawira Mariya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayu 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mariku 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariya kaweriti kagoloka kunja ku lipumba lya mpanga, kankulira. Pakiwiti kankali kankulira, kang'ong'onariti na kusungulira mulipumba lya mpanga, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />na kawawona wantumintumi wa kumpindi wawili yawavaliti nguwu neru mbuu, walivagiti palii nshimba ya Yesu payiweriti yigonjekwa, yumu kumtuwi na mmonga kumagulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Wamahoka awa wamkosiya, “Mdala, shagulira shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Yomberi kawagambira, “Wamwusiya Mtuwa gwangu na nukumana ndiri kwawamtuliti!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Pakatakuliti aga, kagalambuka kumbeli, kamwona Yesu kagoloka paliya, kumbiti kammana ndiri kuwera ndo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu kamkosiya, “Mdala, shagulira shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Gwankumsakula Gani? Mariya, kaliholiti kuwera ayu ndo mlolera shiwunga, kamgambira, “Mtuwa, handa ndo gwenga gumwusiya, gung'ambiri pagumturiti, naneni hang'endi na kumtola.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu kamgambira, “Mariya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Yomberi kagalambuka, kamgambira kwa Shiebraniya, “Raboni” Yani “mfunda.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu kamgambira, “Nangunkola, toziya nankali kugenda kumpindi kwa Tati. Kumbiti gugendi kwa walongu wangu guwagambiri, Nankugenda kumpindi kwa Tati gwangu na Tati gwenu, Mlungu gwangu na Mlungu gwenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariya Magidalena kagenda na kawagambira weri visoweru vilii wafundwa kuwera kamwona Mtuwa na kuwagambira gawamgambira.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wafundwa wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Iweriti pamihi pa lishaka lya jumapili. Wafundwa waweriti waliwona pamuhera mnumba na magomi iweriti itatwa toziya wawatiriti watuwa wa Shiyawudi. Su, Yesu kiza, kagoloka pakati pawu, kawagambira, “Ponga kwamwenga!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Pakamaliriti kutakula aga, kawalanguziya mawoku gakuwi na lubavu lyakuwi. Su, wafundwa awa wasekelera nentu kumwona Mtuwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu kawagambira kayi, “Ponga kwamwenga! Handa viraa Tati ntambu yakantumiti neni, naneni nankuwatuma mwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Pakamaliriti kutakula aga, kawatekelera na kuwagambira, “Mumwanki Rohu Mnanagala. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Pamuwalegeziya wantu vidoda vyawu, hawalegeziwi, pamuwalegeziya ndiri, hapeni walekiziwi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi, yumu gwa walii lilongu na mbili yawamshema mawira kaweriti ndiri pamuhera nawomberi shaka Yesu pakiziti. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Su, wafundwa wamonga walii wamgambira yomberi, “Tumwoniti Mtuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomasi kawagambira, “Pamona ndiri mumawoku mwakuwi shilanguliru zya misumali na kuyingiziya shyala shangu pakati palikovu ali na kuyingiziya liwoku lyangu mluwavu lwakuwi, hapeni njimiri.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Pa mashaka manane wafundwa waweriti kayi pamuhera mnumba mulii na Tomasi kaweriti pamuhera nawomberi. Milyangu iweriti itatwa, kumbiti Yesu kiza, kagoloka pakati pawu, pakatakula, “Ponga iweri pamuhera na mwenga!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Shakapanu kamgambira Tomasi, “Gutuli shyala shaku panu na guloli mawoku gangu, shakapanu gunyoshi liwoku lyaku na gunkoli lubavu lwangu. Guleki kwamini ndiri kwaku, gwenga gwamini!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi kamwankula, “Mtuwa gwangu na Mlungu gwangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu kamgambira, “Hashi, gujimira toziya gumona? Mbaka woseri yawanjimira pamberi pa kumona neni!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nviru ya shintola ashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu katenditi pawulongolu pa wafundwa wakuwi malangaliru gamonga mavuwa galembitwi ndiri munkati mushintola ashi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Kumbiti aga wagalembiti su mpati kwamini handa Yesu ndo Kristu, Mwana gwa Mlungu na kwa kumjimira mpati kuwera na ukomu.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wantumini saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Pa aga, Yesu kawalawiriti kayi wafundwa wakuwi kumbwega ku litanda lya Tiberiya. Ilawiriti hangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Peteru, Tomasi yawamshema wamawira na Nataniyeri mwenikaya gwa kana mu Galilaya wana wawili wa Zebedayu na wafundwa wakuwi wamonga wawili, waweriti woseri pamuhera. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Peteru kawagambira wamonga, “Nankugenda kulowa wasomba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Womberi wamgambira, “Hatugendi na gwenga.” Su wawuka na wakweniti uwatu, kumbiti pashiru poseri wapatiti ndiri shintu. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Payanjiti kushiya, Yesu kagolokiti pampeku pa litanda, kumbiti wafundwa wavimaniti ndiri kuwera yomberi ndo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Su, Yesu kawakosiya, “Wantemba, mlowa ndiri shintu shoseri?” Womberi wamwankula, “Tupata ndiri shintu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwasi zinyavu zyenu uwega wa kumliwu mwa uwatu, hamlowi wasomba.” Su waziyasa zinyavu na waweziti ndiri kuzinika, toziya zinyavu ziweriti na wasomba yawamemiti nduu.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Mfundwa yakafiritwi na Yesu kamgambiriti Peteru, “Ayu Mtuwa” Simoni Peteru pakapikaniriti kuwera ayu ndo Mtuwa, kavala weri nguwu yakuwi toziya kaweriti kavala upati, su kingiriti mumashi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Su wafundwa wamonga wiziti kumbwega ku litanda pawawera muuwatu, wanikiti zinyavu zyaziweriti zimema wasomba. Waweriti ndiri patali na kuisi, iweriti handa utali wa mita malongu lilongu kulawa kumpeku. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Pawasokiti muisi wawoniti motu gwa makala gukoziwa na kuweriti na somba pamuhera na libumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira, “Mjegi panu wasomba wamu wamuwalowiti.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Peteru kakwena muuwatu, kazinika zinyavu zilii kuisi zaziweriti zimema wasomba wakulu miya na malongu muhanu na tatu, tembera wasomba waweriti wavuwa zinyavu zidegeka ndiri. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu kawagambira womberi, “Mwizi mlii.” Kwahera mfundwa ata yumu gwawu yakajeriti kumkosiya, “Gwenga gwa gaa?” Toziya womberi wavimaniti kaweriti Mtuwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Su Yesu kiza, katola libumunda, kawapananiti, katenda hera hangu kwa wasomba walii.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ayi iweriti mala ya tatu Yesu pakawalawiriti wafundwa pakazyukiti kala.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Peteru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pawamaliriti kuliya, Yesu kamkosiyiti Simoni Peteru, “Simoni, mwana gwa Yohani! Hashi, gunfira neni kuliku womberi awa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Peteru kamwankula, “Yina Mtuwa, guvimana kuwera neni nukufira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu kamgambira, “Guloleri wakondolu waneni.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu kamkosiya mala ya pili, “Simoni mwana gwa Yohani! Hashi, gunfira neni?” Peteru kamwankula, “Yina Mtuwa guvimana kuwera nukufira.” Yesu kamgambira, “Guloleri wakondolu waneni.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Mala ya tatu Yesu kamkosiya Peteru, “Simoni mwana gwa Yohani! Hashi, gunfira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Palii Peteru kahinginikiti toziya kamkosiya mala ya tatu, “Gunfira?” Yomberi kamwankula, “Mtuwa, gwenga guvimana vyoseri, gwenga guvimana kuwera neni nukufira.” Yesu kamgambira, “Guloleri wakondolu wa neni! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Nakaka nukugambira, paguweriti muntemba guweriti guweriti kala kugenda koseri kwagufira kugenda, kumbiti paguwera mgogolu, hagukolwi liwoku na muntu gwingi pakakujega paala pagufira ndiri kugenda.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwa kutakula hangu, kulanguziyiti ntambu Peteru pakahowa na kumkwisa Mlungu. Shakapanu Yesu kamgambiriti yomberi, “Gunfati neni!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na wantumintumi wamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Peteru kagalambuka, kamwoniti ntumintumi ulii yakafiritwi na Yesu, kankumfata. Mfundwa ayu ndo mweni ulii shaka sha kuliya shiboga sha pamihi, kalivagiti pakwegera nentu na Yesu pakamkosiya Yesu, “Mtuwa ndo gaa hakakugalambuki?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Peteru pakamwoniti ayu kamkosiya Yesu, “Mtuwa! Na ayu hashi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu kamwankula, “Handa panfira kalikali mpaka panizaku, shikuusu shishi gwenga? Gwenga gunfati neni!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Shisoweru shili shyeniyiti pakati pa walongu kuwera wafundwa ulii hapeni kahowi. Kumbiti Yesu kamgambiriti ndiri kuwera wafundwa ulii hapeni kahowi, ira katakuriti, “Handa panfira kalikali mpaka panizaku shi kuusu shishi gwenga?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ayu ndo mfundwa ulii yakapitawuliti vitwatira avi na kuvilemba. Natwenga tuvimana kuwera gakatakuliti ndo ganakaka.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kwana vitwatira vyamonga vivuwa vyakatenditi Yesu, handa vyangalembwiti vyoseri, shimu kwa shimonga, meiweri pasipanu kwahera pahala pa kutula vintola vyavilembitwi.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>